2 CONT
2 CONT William B. Phelps, Jr. married Lucinda Catherine Thomas on 28 Jun 1837 in Salem, Washington Co., Indiana, and settled there. After the first 3 children were born, they migrated to Davis County, Iowa in 1843 or 44. He was a carpent
2 CONC er, judge (Assoc judge 2nd Judicial Circuit, Washington Co. ca 1833-38) and farmer.
2 CONT
2 CONT After William died(?), Lucinda went to Kentucky to live.
