2 CONT
2 CONT Epaphras Hiram Phelps BIRTH	17 Jun 1817 Delphi Falls, Onondaga County, New York, USA DEATH	1 May 1894 (aged 76) Attica, Marion County, Iowa, USA BURIAL	 Gullion Cemetery Attica, Marion County, Iowa, USA MEMORIAL ID	125046382 · Vie
2 CONC w Source
2 CONT
2 CONT MEMORIAL PHOTOS 1 FLOWERS 3 Epaphras Phelps married Martha Dow b: September 5, 1817 - Hartford, Ct m. Martha Dow. 24 Sept. 1839. d/o Henry and Mercy (Kinney) Dow
2 CONT
2 CONT Epaphras Phelps was a carpenter and builder. He resided in Salem IN, Borden IN, Unionville, Illinois., and Attica, Iowa, where he d. 1 May, 1894. Survived by his widow Martha.
2 CONT
2 CONT Epaphras Hiram Phelps brother of Julia Ann Phelps Sherwood also of Attica, Iowa b. Delphi, N. Y., 17 June, 1817. Removed with his father to Salem, IN, 1819 m. Martha Dow. 24 Sept. 1839. d/o Henry and Mercy (Kinney) Dow, and was b.
2 CONC  Hartford, Ct.. 5 Sept, 1817.
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: William Phelps b: 22 JUN 1783 d: 11 JUL 1846 Elizabeth Jackson b: 11 JUL 1785 d: 30 DEC 1828
2 CONT
