2 CONT Temperance Barber Phelps BIRTH	8 Aug 1718 Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA DEATH	15 Aug 1798 (aged 80) Hebron, Tolland County, Connecticut, USA BURIAL	 Century Cemetery Marlborough, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA MEMO
2 CONC RIAL ID	135057277 · View Source SHARE  SAVE TOSUGGEST EDITS MEMORIAL PHOTOS 0 FLOWERS 6
2 CONT
2 CONT Married July 16th 1738 in Hebron, Tolland County, Connecticut.
2 CONT
2 CONT ********************************
2 CONT
2 CONT She is not on "Hale Cemetery Inscriptions" list, but that does not mean she is not here. The lack of a headstone does not delete one from a burial place. It may have sunken, gotten vandalized or the only remaining child in Tolland
2 CONC  County may not have had one placed for her. It would be odd that she would have been buried elsewhere, when she died just over 2 years after her husband, who also died in Hebron and that her only remaining child who lived in Hebr
2 CONC on at the time of her death, would have buried her somewhere else. That only remaining child is also buried in this cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT ********************************
