2 CONT Notes: Anne E. Phelps was baptized a member of the Reorganized Church of Jesus Christ of Latter Day Saints on 11 May 1873 by Joseph R. Lambert. She attended the Lamoni, Iowa Branch and the Independence, Missouri Branch.
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription
2 CONT They have but dropped their robes of clay
2 CONT To put their shining raiment on.
