2 CONT Charles E Phelps BIRTH	Apr 1871 Marion County, Iowa, USA DEATH	10 Mar 1929 (aged 57) Seattle, King County, Washington, USA BURIAL	 Lake View Cemetery Seattle, King County, Washington, USA  Show Map MEMORIAL ID	67145132 · View Sour
2 CONC ce
2 CONT
2 CONT MEMORIAL PHOTOS 1 FLOWERS 0 Age 57-Seattle. son of Kenney Phelps - Henrietta Wyman. Married Clara per death record
2 CONT
2 CONT Thanks to Find A Grave contributor mhj for correcting errors in earlier posting and providing places born, lived and died, as well as links to parents.
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles E Phelps, age 21, married Clara McKnight, age 18, in Dawson County, Nebraska on 19 Feb 1893. He was b. in Iowa, she in Illinois.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1900 Greeley, Weld County, Colorado, Charley Phelps (29,Iowa) was with wife Clara (26, ILL) and children Mattie (7, Nebraska), Lulu (5, Nebraska), Archie (3, Colorado) and Earl (1, Colorado)
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1910 Greeley, Weld County, Colorado, Charles and Clara were with children Mallie (16, Nebraska) , Lulu(15,Neb) , Archie (13, Col), Earl (11.Col), Louis (9,Col), Helen (3,Col), Albert (10 months, Colorado)
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1920 King Co WA, Charles Phelps, 47,was with Clara and children Archie, Earl, Louis, Helen, Albert, plus Wilber (8, Col), Ralph (6, Col) and Lloyd (2, Montana)
2 CONT
2 CONT Archie E Phelps married Ethel Crooks 26 Aug 1922 in Seattle. Archie Phelps died in Seattle 16 Feb 1954, age 56.
2 CONT
2 CONT Earl Phelps married Mabeth Leonard in Seattle on 12/31/1928 with Mrs Clara Phelps as witness. Earl William Phelps died in Seattle 21 Dec 1959, age 59.
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis E Phelps married Marie Stella Clifford at the King County Courthouse, on 3 Aug 1925, with Earl W Phelps as witness.
2 CONT
2 CONT Clara Phelps died in Seattle 28 Sep 1939, age 65, she was the daughter of Charles McKnight and Annette Surber, wife of Charles E Phelps
