1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Seth Harding, son of Frederick Augusta Harding and Lucy Elizabeth Phelps, was born in Caloma, Iowa on Sept. 1, 1884; he married on Dec. 10, 1919 with ELLA S. OLSON. She was born Dec. 20.1894 in Leenthrop, Minnesota
2 CONC . He died June 1, 1958 and is buried at Oak Park Methodist Cemetery, Kandiyohi Co., Minnesota.
2 CONT
2 CONT *1884 birth record: Seth Harding, s/o Fredrick A. Harding and Lucy Elizabeth Phelps, was born in Marion Co., Iowa on 9/1/1884.
2 CONT *1910 census: Seth Harding (26, b IA); in Franklin, Greene Co., Iowa at res. of his brother Fred A. Harding (30, b IA) and family. He is single.
2 CONT *1920 census: Seth Harding (35, b IA) and wife Ella S. (25, b MN); in Leenthrop, Chippewa Co., Minnesota at res. of his brother Fred A. Harding (40, b Iowa) and family.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''SETH HARDING'''  .....  Birth:  1884  Death:  1958 
2 CONT
