1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://genealogy.gettheball.com/getperson.php?personID=I769&tree=bratt01
2 CONT Leftwich, Augistine 
2 CONT Son of Thomas Sr,   b. Between 1660 and 1670   d. Abt 1730, Caroline County, Virgina  (Age 70 years) and North, Mary,   b. 1686, Essex Co., VA. They married May 1704
2 CONT Augustine:
2 CONT Birth	Between 1712 and 1715 	New Kent Co (Now Caroline Co.), Virginia 
2 CONT Gender	Male 
2 CONT Death	1795 	Bedford County, VA, USA  
2 CONT Burial	1795 	Nr. Goose Creek, Bedford Co., VA 
2 CONT There is a high ridge bordering on Goose Creei in Bedford Co., known as King George's Hill. On the highest point of the hill, John Perrin killed King George, an Indian chief, hence its name. Situated between King George's Hill and
2 CONC  Goose Creek is a fine farm of bottom land, on which Augustine Leftwich settled' here he died in 1795 and was buried on a mound near Goose Greek.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with First Wife 	(Seen as Mary Mosley (Moxley) )
2 CONT * +	1. Leftwich, Frances   d. Between 1794 and 1819
2 CONT *  	2. Leftwich, Nancy   d. Aft 1840
2 CONT *  	3. Leftwich, Rebecca
2 CONT *  	4. Leftwich, Colonel William,   b. 1737   d. 31 May 1820 (Age 83 years)
2 CONT * +	5. Leftwich, Colonel Thomas,   b. 1740, Caroline County, Virgina d. 3 May 1816 (Age 76 years)
2 CONT * +	6. Leftwich, Major Augustine Jr.,   b. 10 Sep 1744   d. intestate 
2 CONT * +	7. Leftwich, Mary,   b. 1746   d. 1818 (Age 72 years)
2 CONT *  	8. Leftwich, Captain Uriah,   b. Abt 1748
2 CONT *  	9. Leftwich, Captain John,   b. Abt 1750   d. 26 Feb 1797, Oglethorpe Co, GA  (Age 47 years)
2 CONT *  	10. Leftwich, Colonel Littleberry,   b. 1757   d. 1823, Bedford County, VA, USA  (Age 66 years)
2 CONT *  	11. Leftwich, General Joel,   b. 22 Nov 1760, Bedford County, VA, USA d. 20 Oct 1846 (Age 85 years)
2 CONT *  	12. Leftwich, Brig. General Jabez,   b. 1766   d. 22 Jun 1855, Alabama  (Age 89 years)
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 2	Stoval, Elizabeth Fuqua 
2 CONT Marriage	1779 	Bedford County, VA, USA 
2 CONT No issue.
2 CONT ----
