1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "(1) Colonel William Leftwich (Augustine, Sr., Thomas, Sr.,
2 CONT Ralph), b.1737, d. May 31, 1820 in Bedford County, Va., married
2 CONT Elizabeth Haynes, cir.1757. She was a daughter of William Haynes
2 CONT and hls wife Elizabeth, who left a will dated April 8, 1780, probated
2 CONT June 25, 1781, in Bedford County, Va. (W. B. "E," p.197). He was a private in the Bedford County, Va., Colonial Militia in 1758. (Hening's Statutes, Vol vn, p. 25)" * https://www.seekingmyroots.com/members/files/G004082.pdf page 2
