2 CONT Daughter of Augustine Leftwich Sr. DNA confirmed and Mary Turner (Moxley) Leftwich
2 CONT Sister of William Leftwich, Thomas Leftwich Sr., Augustine Leftwich Jr., Mary Elizabeth (Leftwich) Early, Uriah Leftwich Sr, John Leftwich, Rebecca (Leftwich) Moorman, Littleberry Leftwich, Lucy (Leftwich) Brown, Joel Leftwich, Na
2 CONC ncy (Leftwich) Pettross and Jabez Leftwich
2 CONT Wife of William Merriman Carter — married 26 Apr 1758 in Bedford, Virginia
2 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
2 CONT Mother of Augustine Carter Sr., Molly (Carter) Alston, Augustine Joel Carter, John Carter, Rebecca (Carter) Caffery, Frances (Carter) St. Clair, William Merriman Carter Jr., Mary (Carter) Fuqua, Nancy (Carter) Reid, James Landon C
2 CONC arter, Elizabeth (Carter) Alston and William Leftwich Carter
2 CONT Died about 1796 at about age 58 in Davidson, Tennessee, United Statesmap
