2 CONT '''Ezra Strong (1733 – 1804)''', son of Ezra Strong (1689 - 1785) and Abigail Caverley (1715 – 1788), was born 3 April 1733 at Hebron, Tolland County, Connecticut; he died at the age of 71 on 7 August 1804 Williamsburg, Hampshire 
2 CONC County, Massachusetts. He married '''Temperance Phelps (1739 – 1810)''' on 24 April 1754 at Williamsburg. 
