1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Ezra Strong (1763 - 1833)''', son of Ezra Strong (1733 - 1804) and Temperance Phelps Strong (1739 - 1810), was born 4 August 1763 at Colchester, New London County, Connecticut; he died at the age of 69 on 28 Feb
2 CONC ruary 1833 while visiting at Oxford, Ontario, Canada; the site of his burial is unknown. He married '''Nancy Gates (1766 - 1819)''' on 19 October 1785 at Goshen, Hampshire County, Massachusetts; they had eleven known children.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children==
2 CONT # John Strong (born 1786 Williamsburg, Hampshire County, Massachusetts)
2 CONT # Ezra Strong (born 26 June 1788 Philipstown, Putnam County, New York)
2 CONT # Nancy Strong (born 1797)
2 CONT # Abigail Strong (1806 - 1868), married 1830 Eli Sheldon (1808 - 1843)
2 CONT # William Strong
2 CONT # Solomon Strong
2 CONT # Silas Gates Strong
2 CONT # Temperance Mary Strong
2 CONT # Eri Strong
2 CONT # Horatio Nelson Strong
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Notes==
2 CONT * Deacon and founder of Congregational Church 
2 CONT * Farmer
2 CONT * One of the first settlers of Hanover, Oneida, New York
2 CONT
