1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Birth: 	May 10, 1676 Death: 	Jan. 1, 1754
2 CONT
2 CONT She died aged 77 yrs.
2 CONT
2 CONT The daughter of John & Elizabeth (Danson) Warren of Boston, she married first Richard Lord III of Hartford on January 12, 1692 in Hartford. They were the parents of ten children. After his death, she married Rev. Timothy Woodbridg
2 CONC e in 1716.
2 CONT
2 CONT The children of Rev. Timothy & Abigail Woodbridge: Susanna bpt. Feb. 6, 1703-4, m. Richard Treat of Sheffield Ashbel bpt. June 10, 1705, m. Jerusha (Pitkin) Edwards (Families of Early Hartford, Connecticut, p. 692) 
