2 CONC  · View Source SHARE  SAVE TOSUGGEST EDITS MEMORIAL PHOTOS 3 FLOWERS 1 Comfort Clemmons was the daughter of Peter Clemmons, for whom the town of Clemmons was named. Her mother was Comfort Coston Clemmons. Comfort married Pleasant 
2 CONC Chaffin and he died in 1815. She and Pleasant had children, Ann Chaffin(Hunt), Dickerson Chaffin, who moved to Prairie Co AR and Arthur Chaffin, who is buried at Eccles family cemetery, Forsyth Co NC, which see. She then married C
2 CONC ol Hiram Phelps and they had two sons. Hiram is buried here, and Pleasant's burial place is unknown, unless he is also buried at Eccles Cemetery.
