1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Betsy Leftwich''' was born in 1737 in Bedford County, VA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-82135456 Colonel William W. Haynes, Jr.] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-90357713 Elizabeth Haynes]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth married [https://www.geni.com/profile-40166951 Col. William Leftwich Leftwich, Sr.] in 1757 in VA. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-3063040 Mary Haynes Walton]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-12732497 Sally Frances Turner]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-3063054 Rev. William &quot;Black Head&quot; Leftwich, Jr.]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-3063021 General Jesse Leftwich]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-79909658 Mildred Leftwich]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-3063029 Elizabeth Burton]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-54263083 Camillus]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-3063012 John Leftwich]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-3063033 James Leftwich]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34709479994 Nancy M. Eshelman]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1820 in Bedford County, VA, and was buried there. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
