1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''General Jesse Leftwich''' was born in 1771 in Bedford, Bedford County, Virginia, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-40166951 Col. William Leftwich Leftwich, Sr.] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-4016
2 CONC 6952 Elizabeth Betsy Leftwich]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Jesse married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765918465 Theodoshia Ayers Leftwich (Trigg)] on July 21, 1791 in Bedford, Virginia. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765918170 Amelia Leftwich (Anthony)]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765918468 John Trigg Leftwich]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Jesse married [https://www.geni.com/profile-3063132 Doshia Leftwich] on July 21, 1791. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1845 in Florence, Lauderdale, Alabama, United States. 
