1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Rev John Bliss
2 CONT BIRTH	23 Oct 1690, Norwich, New London County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT DEATH	1 Feb 1741 (aged 50), Hebron, Tolland County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT BURIAL	Godfrey Hill Cemetery, Hebron, Tolland County, Connecticut, USA, MEMORIAL ID 36166445
2 CONT
2 CONT John graduated from Yale College in 1710 and was ordained as the first settled pastor of the Congregational Church at Hebron (CT) in October of 1717. He was dismissed in 1734 and was fined by the County Court at Hartford, CT becau
2 CONC se of "dissenting" views. He then joined the Episcopal Church where he was a lay reader for the rest of his life.  (From the Genealogy of the Bliss Family, supplied by fellow FAG member Patti Low
