2 CONT
2 CONT Ellis Bliss was married twice:
2 CONT
2 CONT First was Tamar Dewey who died November 29, 1769. They were married 17 April 1757.
2 CONT
2 CONT Second wife was Grace Ford, they married February 11, 1746/7 in Hebron, Tolland Co., CT. Ellis died 15 Oct 1829 Hebron, Tolland Co., CT. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Two of their children were Isaac Bliss 1778-1852 (As per the Bliss book, Isaac was known in the Lewis County, NY area as an agent for banks and businessmen. He was esteemed as an honest and trustworthy man. P. 147). and Benjamin B
2 CONC liss 1776- 1858
