1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Patience Barber Gilbert=
2 CONT * BIRTH 1757 Hebron, Tolland County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 14 May 1838 (aged 80–81)
2 CONT * BURIAL Andover Road Cemetery, Hebron, Tolland County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 45187272 contributor Kendell W. Phillips
2 CONT
2 CONT Patience' maiden name was Barber. She was the daughter of Capt. Daniel Barber and his wife Abigail Newcomb, and was born in Hebron, then Hartford, now Tolland Co., Connecticut Colony. She married the Hon. Sylvester Gilbert, (a mem
2 CONC ber of the Continental Congress), also buried in this Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Inscription'''
2 CONT Wife of Hon. Sylvester: age 90 yrs.
2 CONT
