1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Phelps-542
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Alexander Phelps (1723 - 1773)==
2 CONT
2 CONT Alexander Phelps was born 6 Jan 1723 in Hebron, Tolland, Connecticut to Nathaniel Phelps I and Abigail (Filley) Phelps. He is the brother of Hannah (Phelps) Sherwin [half], Nathaniel Phelps II [half], Prudence (Pinney) Stanley [ha
2 CONC lf], Anne (Pinney) Phelps [half], Ann Pinney [half], Oliver Pinney [half], Solomon Phelps [half], Isaac Pinney [half], Abigail (Phelps) Allen and Mehitabel (Phelps) Ingham
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Anna (Unknown) Phelps — married 20 Jul 1749 [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Theodora (Wheelock) Young — married 9 Feb 1751 in Hebron, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Anne Phelps, Sarah Phelps, Theodotia Phelps and Davenport Phelps
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 19 Apr 1773 in Lyme, Grafton, New Hampshire
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 11 Jan 2019 | Created 28 May 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT Phelps, Oliver. The Phelps Family Of America And Their English Ancestors (Eagle Pub. Co., Pittsfield, Mass., 1899) Vol. 1, Page 155.
2 CONT Ancestry.com Historical Records, Connecticut, Births and Christenings, 1649-1906 Ancestry Family Trees (Ancestry.com, Provo, UT, USA) Family Tree files submitted by Ancestry members. Ancestry Profile
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT * Alexander Phelps
2 CONT * MyHeritage Family Trees
2 CONT * 7995802-86 in Family site (GenCircles), managed by Marilynn Munoz (Contact)
2 CONT * Birth:	Jan 6 1723/24 - Hebron, Tolland, Connecticut
2 CONT * Death:	Apr 19 1773 - Lime, NH
2 CONT * Parents:	Nathaniel Phelps, Abigail Phelps (born Pinney)
2 CONT * Siblings:	Hannah Sherwin (born Phelps), Nathaniel (Lt.) Phelps, Joshua Phelps, Solomon Phelps, Abigail Bartholomew (born Phelps), Mehitabel Ingham (born Phelps)
2 CONT * Wife:	Anne Phelps
2 CONT * Wife:	Theodora Wheelock
2 CONT * Children:	Theodotia Phelps, Anne Phelps, Sarah Phelps, Davenport (Rev.) Phelps, Theodora Phelps, Alexander (Dr.) Phelps, Lucey Phelps, Emelia Phelps, Eleazar Wheelock Phelps, Ralph Rodolphus Phelps
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT When Alexander Phelps was born on 6 January 1723, in Hebron, Tolland, Connecticut, United States, his father, Nathaniel Phelps, was 45 and his mother, Abigail Filley, was 38. He married Anna Phelps on 20 January 1749. They were th
2 CONC e parents of at least 2 daughters. He died on 19 April 1773, in Grafton, New Hampshire, United States, at the age of 50.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/D9NW-44N
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT 196. Hon. Alexander Phelps, b. Hebron, Ct., 6 Jan., 1723-4, m. 1st Mrs, Anna Phelps, a widow, 20 Jan., 1749. Shed. Hebron, Ct., 13th Apr., 1750. He m, 2nd Theodora Wheelock, 9 Feb., 1751, daughter of the Rev. Elea- zer Wheelock, a
2 CONC nd possibly a widow.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Rev. Eleazer Wheelock was one of the founders and first president of Dartmouth, and a descendant of Ralph Wheelock of Shropshire, Eng., who emigrated to New Eng- land in 1637, settling first in Dedham, and from there to Med- f
2 CONC ield.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://archive.org/details/phelpsfamilyofam01phel/page/156/mode/1up?q=Alexander+Phelps+
