2 CONC f> <ref name="TAGvol65"> ''The English Origin of William Phelps of Dorchester, Mass. and Windsor, Conn., With Notes on his Marriages'', by Myrtle Stevens Hyde, F.A.S.G., TAG vol 65, p 161, 164 citing ''Windsor Early Records, page 
2 CONC 56</ref> Timothy married 19 Mar 1661/62 to Mary Griswold at Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut <ref name="GMB" /> <ref name="TAGvol65" /> Children of Timothy and Mary (Griswold) Phelps:<ref> ''Record of Marriages and Births, in Windso
2 CONC r, CT''], Edited by Samuel H. Parsons, Esq.,NEHGR Vol 5 (1851) page 230 https://archive.org/stream/newenglandhistor005wate#page/230/mode/1up</ref><ref>"The Phelps family of America and their English ancestors : with copies of will
2 CONC s, deeds, letters, and other interesting papers, coats of arms and valuable records" by Oliver Seymour Phelps, and Andrew Tinkey Servin publ 1899 , p 96-97 https://archive.org/stream/phelpsfamilyofam01phel#page/96/mode/1up</ref>
