2 CONT == Parents and Siblings ==Timothy's father, William Phelps, emigrated from Crewkerne, Somersetshire, England, to Dorchester, Massachusetts, with his second wife, Anne(Dover) Phelps and his children, William, Samuel, Nathaniel, and
2 CONC  Joseph, in 1630 aboard the ship ''Mary and John''. <ref name="TAGvol65"/>
2 CONT Most of the records for this family in England can be found at Crewkerne Parish, Crewkerne, Somerset Co., England.  This info can also be found in Great Migrations. Series, and (www.dunhamwilcox.net).
2 CONT
