2 CONT == Biography ==Cornelius was born 26 April 1671, in Windsor, Connecticut. He was the son of [[Phelps-733|Timothy Phelps]] and [[Griswold-237|Mary Griswold]].<ref name="Phelps">Phelps, Oliver Seymour,. The Phelps family of America 
2 CONC and their English ancestors : with copies of wills, deeds, letters, and other interesting papers, coats of arms and valuable records. Pittsfield, Mass.: Eagle Pub. Co., 1899.</ref>
2 CONT Cornelius Phelps married Sarah Mansfield in Windsor<ref Name="BrbrW"> Connecticut Vital Records to 1870 - Windsor. (Online Database: AmericanAncestors.org, New England Historic Genealogical Society, 2011.) Fromoriginal typescripts
2 CONC , Lucius Barnes Barbour Collection, 1928.</ref> They lived in Windsor, where he died in 1741. In his will (Hartford Probate Records, 8th March, 1741-2.), he mentions his wife Sarah, and sons Cornelius, John, Timothy, Isaac, and da
2 CONC ughter Sarah Hutchinson.<refname="Phelps"/>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''<ref name="Phelps"/> born in Windsor:
2 CONT # Sarah, b, 7 Dec, bap, 19 Dec, 1705, m. Hutchinson.
2 CONT # Cornelius, b. 2 June, 1707, m, Hannah Phelps.
2 CONT # John, b. 6 July, 1710, m, two times.
2 CONT # Timothy, b. 3 Feb., 1713, m. Margaret Gillett.
2 CONT # Isaac, b. 22 July, 1722, m. Margaret Mills.
2 CONT # Lot (or Lanslot), b, 1724.
2 CONT
