2 CONT The children of John Bissell, Sr. and his unnamed first wife, the order uncertain, are:
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. Samuel Bissell, b. circa 1637 in England, d. testate at Windsor Dec. 3, 1700; m. 1) June 11, 1658 at Windsor, Abigail Holcomb, dau. of Thomas and Elizabeth Holcomb, bapt. Jan. 6, 1638/9 at Windsor, Conn. She d. at Windsor Aug.
2 CONC  17, 1688. Nine children of the family. Samuel m. 2) after Aug. 1688, Mary Buell, dau. of William Buell and Mary Post, and widow of Simon Mills, latter who d. intestate at Simsbury, Conn. July 6, 1683. There were no children by th
2 CONC is marriage, Mary having ten children by her first husband. She d. testate at Windsor, Conn. June 24, 1718.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT (f/g) Samuel Bissell Birth: 	unknown, England Death: 	Dec. 3, 1700 Windsor Hartford County Connecticut, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Bissell, s. of John Bissell and his unnamed first wife, b. on an unknown date, prob. in England. He d. testate at Windsor, Conn. 1697. His age at death is not stated in the record.
2 CONT
2 CONT  [see f/g # 51098382 for extended bio]
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Parents:
2 CONT   John Bissell (1591 - 1677) 
2 CONT  Spouses:
