2 CONC is first wife, Richard,3 Goodrich, s. of Capt. Ephraim,2 Goodrich (Ens. William,1) and Sarah Treat (Ens. Richard,2 Esq. Richard,1) of Wethersfield, Conn. Five children of the marriage.
