1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://wc.rootsweb.com/trees/190739/I031063/sarah-jones/individual
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Jones was born 19 APR 1654 in Boston, MA, and died 14 APR 1733 in New London, CT.. She was the daughter of Rice Jones and Ann Griggs. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married John Prentice on 23 NOV 1675, son of Hesther Nichols and John Prentice. He was born 6 AUG 1652 in New London, CT, and died 21 MAR 1714/15 in New London, CT. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sarah Jones and John Prentice include 
2 CONT * Joseph Prentice was born BEF 4 FEB 1676/77 in New London, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT John3 Prentis son of John and Hester m Nov 23, 1675 Sarah Jones, dau of Mrs Ann Latimer by her first husband Matthew Jones of Boston Mass. Elizabeth Latimer, her half sister, m Jonathan her husband's brother, John Prentis, like hi
2 CONC s father, was a seaman as appears by the following. John Prentice Jr upon his petition had the grant of a permit to sayle from New London to the Island of Barbadoes in the barke Adventure with five men provided he carry no prohibi
2 CONC ted goods Journal of the Council Oct 29 1675 
2 CONT
2 CONT John Prentice Jr master of the ship New London Action of debt against said ship for wages in navigating said ship to Europe and back Minutes of Cases in County Court 1690 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
