1 NOTE {geni:about_me} MIGHILL, Samuel, s. of Rev. Thomas, b. in Scituate, 1685, grad. H. C. 1704, taught the Grammar School in Had., and d. in So. H., April 11, 1769. He m. 1709, Sarah Dickinson. Child— Sarah, b. April 12, 1710, m. Jan.
