1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Abigail Little (Marsh)''' was born circa 1718 in Hadley, Hampshire County, Province of Massachusetts. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-35387834 Sgt John Marsh] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-87712938 Hannah Mar
2 CONC sh (King)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail married [https://www.geni.com/profile-35267288 Waitstill Hastings] on October 1, 1736. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-57498299 Hon John Waitsfield Hastings];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34709089515 Abigail Wolcott (Hastings)];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-35152573 Hannah Bernard Kellogg (Hastings)];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34709089513 Mary Hastings];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34709089514 Samuel Hastings]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail married [https://www.geni.com/profile-51190753 Hon. John Prentice Bulkeley] on April 16, 1751 in Colchester, New London County, Connecticut, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34654913733 Capt. Charles Bulkley]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail married [https://www.geni.com/profile-19616816 Rev. Ephraim Little] on November 5, 1755 in Colchester, New London, CT. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-19619085 Sophia Little];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-19619086 Justin Little]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on June 24, 1786 in Colchester, New London County, Connecticut, United States and was buried in Colchester Burying Ground, Colchester, New London County, Connecticut, USA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Tombstone Inscription
2 CONT >in 69th yr, consort of Rev Ephraim Little
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT {{https://www.geni.com/media/proxy?media_id=6000000199663786822&size=large}}
2 CONT ----
