2 CONT Gershom  Bulkeley,  son  of  Rev.  John  and  Patience  Prentice 
2 CONT Bulkeley,  born  February  4,  1709;  married  Abigail  Rollins,  No- 
2 CONT vember 28,  1733.  He  was  a  prominent  citizen  of  Colchester,  and 
2 CONT held  many  important  offices  of  trust. 
