1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT She died at age 87 years.
2 CONT (Families of Early Hartford, Connecticut, p. 687)
2 CONT
2 CONT The idea that her maiden name was Crow, or that she was the widow Crow, was put to rest in the January 1971 issue of The American Genealogist (Vol. 47, No.1, page 17). It is quite clear that she was Elizabeth Danson.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married as follows:
2 CONT * 1. John Warren of Exeter, NH, then Boston about 1669
2 CONT * 2. Samuel Sendall of Newbury, then Boston 4 Oct, 1681
2 CONT * 3. John Hayward of Boston about 1685
2 CONT * 4. Phineas Wilson of Hartford about 1689.
2 CONT
2 CONT When she died in 1727 her estate was valued at 7154 pounds, a huge sum for the time.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
