2 CONT MEMORIAL PHOTOS 0 FLOWERS 0 Born in Whitby Ontario to John and Sarah (Jarden) Devlin. Married Epaphrus Lord Phelps in Mount Pleasant, Ontario on February 5, 1867. Had six children (4 sons and 2 daughters). Was widowed in 1898 and 
2 CONC followed her son George Walter Phelps west to Minnedosa, Manitoba. Not absolutely sure she is buried in Minnedosa, but because she died there, it is very likely. Children NOT included on Find a Grave are John Hiram Phelps (1869-18
2 CONC 99) and Mary Ellen 'Ellie' Phelps Smith.
2 CONT
