2 CONT MEMORIAL PHOTOS 1 FLOWERS 1 Son of Epaphras Lord and Elizabeth Ann (Devlin) Phelps. Husband of Ida Evelyn Swinbank. Father of William Epaphras Phelps, Olive Roberta(Phelps) Tod, Charles Walter Phelps, George Harold Phelps, and Joh
2 CONC n Swinbank Phelps. Apprenticed as a clerk, then moved west at age 14 to clerk in Minnedosa. He eventually owned his own store in Minnedosa. The depression was very hard on small business owners and he had to sell up before moving 
2 CONC to Winnipeg to work. He later moved to Fort Frances, Ontario where his son Harold worked as a Safeway manager. He loved fishing and gardening.
