1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Derk Alberts Zuiderweg''' was born on May 26, 1820 in Zuidwending, gem. Veendam. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-51952636 Albert Jakobs Zuiderweg] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-51952637 Elisabeth Daniels Dani
2 CONC ëls Kotter]. He was a Boerenknecht. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Derk married [https://www.geni.com/profile-51952651 Hindrikje Hindriks Pot] on November 25, 1844 in Veendam. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-52508674 Albert Zuiderweg]; [https://www.geni.com
2 CONC /profile-51952652 Fokkien Zuiderweg]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-52508663 Elisabeth Zuiderweg]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Derk married [https://www.geni.com/profile-51952954 Jantina Brill] on October 9, 1890 in Wildervank, Veendam, GR, Netherlands. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-52510274 Geerdiena Annechiena Z
2 CONC uiderweg]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in Wildervank?. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Huwelijk: https://www.openarch.nl/gra:d0244568-2d12-572a-1910-81ff2025070a<br/>
