1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The Muse (Mewes) Family of the Northern Neck of Virginia Mary Hope West, Juliet Fauntleroy and Mary N. West The Virginia Magazine of History and Biography
2 CONT  Vol. 53, No. 2 (Apr., 1945), pp. 132-138  (article consists of 7 pages) 
2 CONT ====================
2 CONT 945. John Mewes10 MUSE * (Edward Mewes11, Edward Mewes12, Barthomew Mewes13) was born in Bedfordshire, Shouldrod, ENGLAND 13 OCT 1633. John died 10 AUG 1723 in Westmoreland Co, VA, at 89 years of age. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Catherine LEWIS-MOSS-TALBOT * 16 NOV 1698. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He made a will in Westmoreland Co, VA, 5 APR 1723.(1025) MUSE, John 5 APR 1723 8 OCT 1723 To son Thomas one shilling; dau Jane Pritchett one shilling; dau Ann Willson one shilling; dau Mary Quisenberry one shilling; rest of estate
2 CONC  to dau in law Ann MUSE 
2 CONT
2 CONT John Mewes MUSE* and Catherine LEWIS-MOSS-TALBOT* had the following children: 
2 CONT *   946 i. Edward9 MEWES was born on (birth date unknown). 
2 CONT *   947 ii. Thomas MUSE Sr was born in Westmoreland Co, VA CA 1665. Thomas died BEF 28 JUN 1732 in Westmoreland Co, VA, at approximately 66 years of age. He married Elizabeth STURMAN in Westmoreland Co, VA, CA 1710. 
2 CONT *    948 iii. John MUSE, Jr was born in Westmoreland Co, VA CA 1673. John died 28 JUL 1718 in Westmoreland Co, VA, at 45 years of age. He married Ann SANFORD HOPKINS CA 1712.   
2 CONT *   He purchased land 1703 in Westmoreland Co, VA. 
2 CONT *  +948a / 772 iv. Mary MUSE*  (John Mewes10, Edward Mewes11, Edward Mewes12, Barthomew Mewes13) was born in Westmoreland Co, VA CA 1677. Mary died CA 1723. She married Humphery QUESENBERRY  in Westmoreland Co, VA, 1696. (See Hump
2 CONC hery QUESENBERRY* for the children resulting from this marriage.)
2 CONT *   949 v. Ann MUSE was born CA 1677. Ann died AFT 1723. She married John WILSON. 
2 CONT *   950 vi. Nicholas MEWES was born in Westmoreland Co, VA CA 1685. Nicholas died 1716 at 31 years of age. He married Mary ELLIOTT. 
2 CONT *   951 vii. Jane MEWES was born CA 1696. She married Christorpher PRITCHETT.
