1 NOTE Name Suffix: Sr
2 CONT Proven by Fathers Will.
2 CONT Thomas's children are proven by his Will of 12 March 1729, probated 28 June 1738, Westmoreland Co., Virginia Will and Deed Book #8, part 2, page 175. Sons Nicholas and Daniel proven by mother s will.
2 CONT
