1 NOTE Christy Flynn lists her name as Elizabeth Sturman, as does Rev.
2 CONT McLeod.
2 CONT
2 CONT SOUTHERN LEGACY notes: Elizabeth was twice a widow. Her first
2 CONT husband was John Stewart, and her second husband was Bryant Murphy.
2 CONT Her maiden name was Sturman.
2 CONT Elizabeth named Daniel and Nicholas Muse in her will, probated 25 May
2 CONT 1735 in Westmoreland Co., VA, as well as children by former
2 CONT marriages. The son William named in the will was not a Muse, but
2 CONT rather her son William Stewart by a previous marriage.
2 CONT
2 CONT [Rhonda Randall.ged]
2 CONT
2 CONT Name Suffix: Sr
