1 NAME Augustine /North/
2 GIVN Augustine
2 _MARNM North
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1628
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Probably England
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1692
2 ADDR
3 CITY Ware Parish
3 STAE Virginia
