1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Theodoshia Ayers Leftwich (Trigg)''' was born in 1770 in Bedford, Bedford, Virginia, United States. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Theodoshia married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765918464 General Jesse Leftwich] on July 21, 1791, in Bedford, Virginia. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765918170 Amelia Leftwich (Anth
2 CONC ony)]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765918468 John Trigg Leftwich]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1813 in Bedford, Bedford, Virginia, United States. 
2 CONT ----
