1 NOTE {geni:about_me} She married Henry Hodge on 23 JUN 1845 in Henry Co., TN after the death of her first husband, James Carter. Susannah's remains were removed to Henry-Breedlove Cemetery when US Highway 79 was widened and bypassed th
2 CONC e town of Henry, taking the site of this cemetery. For more information and a picture of her stone, please see FAG memorial #33114616. (bio by: M. A. Claxton) 
