1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Hezekiah Rice, Jr.''' was born in 1801. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-17504560 Hezekiah Benjamin Rice] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-17505146 Mary Polly Rice, Smith]. He was a Buried in Rice Family Cemetery
2 CONC  in Anderson County,South Carolina. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hezekiah married [https://www.geni.com/profile-17617801 Jane Rice]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34648995280 Louisa Larentiah Rice]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on March 2, 1836 in Belton, South Carolina, United States. 
2 CONT ----
