1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Abner B Anthony''' was born on November 28, 1812 in Virginia, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765657509 Capt. Mark Anthony, I] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34839594016 Emelie (Amelia) Anthony]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Abner married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34839595324 Jane L Anthony]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on July 24, 1908 in Campbell County, Virginia, USA. 
