1 NOTE {geni:about_me} No pictures exist of Michael Brown and his wife, Elizabeth Shelton. Several people have mistaken a picture of their son, Elijah and his wife, Jane Bertram, with their first three children, as representing Michael a
2 CONC nd Elizabeth. I know because I own the only known original of the picture and shared it years ago online.
2 CONT
2 CONT Michael Brown was on the 1830 Federal Census and the 1833 Enumeration of Male Voters in Fentress Co., Tennessee. By 1840 he had moved his household to Jackson Co., Tennessee. In 1846 he had land surveyed in Clinton Co., Kentucky, 
2 CONC where he lived until his death in 1858.
2 CONT
2 CONT His death was recorded at the courthouse in Clinton Co., Kentucky and the record has survived to this day on microfilm. Only one parent, Tabetha Brown, was listed on it. She was not the same as the Tabetha Gorman who married a Bro
2 CONC wn as some researchers have circulated without proof.    
2 CONT
2 CONT About 1829 Michael married Elizabeth Shelton, daughter of George Shelton, a Revolutionary War soldier who drew a pension while residing his last years in Fentress Co., Tennessee. Michael Brown and his father-in-law lived in the ar
2 CONC ea lying very near or on the line between Clinton Co., Kentucky and Fentress County, Tennessee -- before Pickett Co., Tennessee came into existence. Their graves have never been located but are believed to have been in that same a
2 CONC rea, possibly on land that belonged to Michael Brown. Part of his small land grant was in Kentucky and part of it in Tennessee. 
2 CONT Elizabeth "Betsy" and Michael had 10 children:
2 CONT # Sarah, 
2 CONT # William, 
2 CONT # Mary, 
2 CONT # Amanda Jane, 
2 CONT # Enoch C., 
2 CONT # Elijah, 
2 CONT # John Matt, 
2 CONT # Rosena, 
2 CONT # Eli H., and 
2 CONT # Thomas Jefferson Brown.
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/43443775/michael-brown Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 12 2026, 21:11:04 UTC''
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/43443775/michael-brown Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jul 1 2026, 15:59:42 UTC''
2 CONT ----
