1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT John Drake, III
2 CONT
2 CONT BIRTH	14 Sep 1649 Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT DEATH	7 Jul 1689 (aged 39) Simsbury, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT BURIAL	 Simsbury Cemetery
2 CONT
2 CONT Simsbury, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT PLOT	Older section near the entrance of the cemetery
2 CONT
2 CONT John married Mary Watson, the daughter of Robert Watson and Mary Rockwell on March 20, 1671. Mary died on August 7, 1693 in Simsbury, Connecticut, but she has no grave marker near her husband. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John's marker has a death year of 1688, a year earlier than Town records give it. However, the probating of John's estate in 1689 would agree with the Town Records, so 1689 was used on his memorial.
2 CONT
