2 CONT
2 CONT Enoch Drake Sr.
2 CONT Born 8 Dec 1655 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticutmap
2 CONT ANCESTORS ancestors
2 CONT Son of John Drake Jr. and Hannah (Moore) Drake
2 CONT Brother of John Drake III, Job Drake, Hannah (Drake) Higley, Ruth (Drake) Barber, Simon Drake, Lydia (Drake) Loomis, Elisabeth (Drake) Buckland, Mary (Drake) Marshall, Mindwell (Drake) Loomis and Joseph Drake
2 CONT Husband of Sarah (Porter) Drake — married 11 Nov 1680 (to 1698) in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticutmap
2 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
2 CONT Father of Sarah Porter (Drake) Trumbull, Enoch Drake Jr, Nathaniel Drake Sr., Samuel Drake and Hannah (Drake) Sheldon
2 CONT Died 21 Aug 1698 at age 42 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticutmap
2 CONT PROBLEMS/QUESTIONSProfile manager: Patricia Kent private message [send private message]
2 CONT Profile last modified 25 Jul 2020 | Created 28 Nov 2010
2 CONT This page has been accessed 1,539 times.
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Enoch maried as her first husband, Sarah Porter, on 11 Nov 1680 at Windsor, Hartford, CT - parents of Sara, Enoch, Nathaniel, Samuel and Hannah Drake
2 CONT
2 CONT Named in his Father's 1689 Will (Manwaring)
2 CONT
2 CONT Name: John Drake Senior, of Windsor
2 CONT Will written: 12 September 1689
2 CONT Inventory taken: 31 October 1689
2 CONT Son Job Drake
2 CONT Son Enoch Drake
2 CONT Son Simon Drake
2 CONT Son Joseph Drake
2 CONT Daughter Lydia
2 CONT Daughter Elizabeth
2 CONT Daughter Mindwell
2 CONT Daughter Mary
2 CONT Son John's three children: John and two daughters
2 CONT Daughter Ruth
2 CONT Executors: Son Job Drake and son-in-law Samuel Barber
2 CONT
2 CONT Enoch Drake of Windsor died August 21, 1698. His widow, married Sergt. Josiah Barber on November 3, 1698. Enoch Drake chose Cat. Matthew Alyn to be his Guardian. Nathaniel chose Timothy Loomis as guardian. Youngest child, 6 years 
2 CONC old, court appointed Sergt. Josiah Barber, with the Mother of it, for its Guardian.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
