1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Lydia Drake1===
2 CONT * F, b. 26 January 1661, d. 7 May 1702
2 CONT * Father: John Drake b. c 1625, d. b 31 Oct 1689
2 CONT * Mother: Hannah Moore b. s 1628, d. 16 Feb 1685/86
2 CONT
2 CONT Lydia Drake was born on 26 January 1661 at Windsor, Hartford Co., Connecticut.2 She was baptized on 2 February 1661 at Windsor, Hartford Co., Connecticut.3
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Joseph Loomis, son of Joseph Loomis and Sarah Lyman, at Windsor, Hartford Co., Connecticut, on 10 April 1681.4
2 CONT
2 CONT Lydia Drake died on 7 May 1702 at Simsbury, Hartford Co., Connecticut.5
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children 
2 CONT # Joseph Loomis6 b. 28 Nov 1682, d. 19 Mar 1682/83
2 CONT # Joseph Loomis6 b. 8 Oct 1684
2 CONT # Caleb Loomis6 b. 10 Oct 1686, d. 5 Mar 1686/87
2 CONT # Lydia Loomis+6 b. 17 Feb 1687/88, d. 28 Mar 1760
2 CONT # Martha Loomis+6 b. 13 Oct 1690, d. 2 Sep 1751
2 CONT # Rachel Loomis+6 b. bt 12 Jun 1692 - 1693
2 CONT # Enoch Loomis6 b. 23 Mar 1694/95
2 CONT # Phoebe Loomis+6 b. 1697
2 CONT # Damaris Loomis6 b. 29 Jul 1699, d. 1 Jun 1705
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
2 CONT
2 CONT Lydia was born on 26 Jan 1661 at Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut Colony. She was baptized on 2 Feb 1661 at the Congregational Church.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lydia Drake, daughter of John Sr., married Joseph Loomis, son of Joseph, on 10 Apr 1681 in Windsor.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Lydia, wife of Joseph died May 7, 1702, in Windsor[1] at 40 years of age. Joseph married again.
2 CONT
2 CONT Name
2 CONT
2 CONT Lydia Drake[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth
2 CONT
2 CONT 26 JAN 1660/61 Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut[2]
2 CONT Marriage
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband: Joseph Loomis
2 CONT Child: Joseph Loomis
2 CONT 1681 Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut[2]
2 CONT Named in his Father's 1689 Will[3]
2 CONT Name: John Drake Senior, of Windsor
2 CONT Will written: 12 September 1689
2 CONT Inventory taken: 31 October 1689
2 CONT Son Job Drake
2 CONT Son Enoch Drake
2 CONT Son Simon Drake
2 CONT Son Joseph Drake
2 CONT Daughter Lydia
2 CONT Daughter Elizabeth
2 CONT Daughter Mindwell
2 CONT Daughter Mary
2 CONT Son John's three children: John and two daughters
2 CONT Daughter Ruth
2 CONT Executors: Son Job Drake and son-in-law Samuel Barber
2 CONT
