2 CONT
2 CONT ===Lydia (Drake) Loomis (1661 - 1702) 
2 CONT ===
2 CONT
2 CONT Lydia Loomis formerly Drake
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 26 Jan 1661 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of John Drake Jr. and Hannah (Moore) Drake
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of John Drake III, Job Drake, Hannah (Drake) Higley, Enoch Drake Sr., Ruth (Drake) Barber, Simon Drake, Elisabeth (Drake) Buckland, Mary (Drake) Marshall, Mindwell (Drake) Loomis and Joseph Drake
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Joseph Loomis III — married 10 Apr 1681 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Hannah (Loomis) Whitcomb, Joseph Loomis IV, Caleb Loomis, Lydia (Loomis) Hinsdale, Martha (Loomis) Bissell, Rachel (Loomis) Lombard, Enoch Loomis, Phoebe (Loomis) Munsell and Damaris Loomis
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 7 May 1702 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT Welles, Edwin. Births, Marriages, and Deaths Returned from Hartford, Windsor, and Fairfield, and Entered in the Early Land Records of the Colony of Connecticut (Case, Lockwood & Brainard Co., 1898) Page 15
2 CONT Yates Publishing, U.S. and International Marriage Records, 1560-1900 (Provo, UT, USA, The Generations Network, Inc., 2004)
2 CONT Manwaring, Charles William. A Digest of the Early Connecticut Probate Records (R. S. Peck & Co., Printers, 1904) Page 440
2 CONT ↑ 1.0 1.1 Windsor. Connecticut Vital Records to 1870 (Online Database: AmericanAncestors.org, New England Historic Genealogical Society, 2011.) From original typescripts, Lucius Barnes Barbour Collection, 1928. Caleb p 169, Joseph
2 CONC  m. p. 175
2 CONT ↑ 2.0 2.1 2.2 Yates
2 CONT ↑ Manwaring
2 CONT [edit]
