2 CONT
2 CONT Comments 
2 CONT
2 CONT Currently Lydia is linked in marriage to Joseph Loomis, son of Joseph, and also Joseph Loomis, son of John. I am fairly sure the one born in 1649 was her actual husband, and the one born in 1651 married Hannah Marsh.  fixed 20 Sep
2 CONC t 2013
