1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mary was the daughter of John Drake and Hannah Moore. She was born in Windsor, Connecticut on January 29, 1666. She married Thomas Marshall on March 3, 1686. He was the son of Samuel Marshall & Mary Wilton. Her hus
2 CONC band was a deacon in the church of Windsor and they had 11 children. Thomas was an original proprietor of Torrington, Connecticut, but they never settled there. Mary died in Windsor on December 2, 1728, and is buried in the Palisa
2 CONC do Cemetery.
