1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Joseph Drake===
2 CONT * M, b. 26 June 1674, d. 14 January 1754
2 CONT * Father: John Drake b. c 1625, d. b 31 Oct 1689
2 CONT * Mother: Hannah Moore b. s 1628, d. 16 Feb 1685/86
2 CONT * Joseph Drake was born on 26 June 1674 at Windsor, Hartford Co., Connecticut.1
2 CONT * He was baptized on 28 June 1674 at Windsor, Hartford Co., Connecticut.2
2 CONT * He married first at Windsor, Hartford Co., Connecticut, circa 1696 Ann Morton, daughter of William Morton and Mary Burnham.3
2 CONT * Joseph Drake married second after September 1717 Sarah Fitch, daughter of Capt. Joseph Fitch and Mary Stone.4
2 CONT * Joseph Drake died on 14 January 1754 at Windsor, Hartford Co., Connecticut; "in his 81st yr."4,1
2 CONT * Also known as Josiah Drake.5
2 CONT * Also known as Capt. Joseph Drake.4,6
2 CONT * His will was dated on 4 March 1746/47 names children but no wife (Hartford Probate File 1767).7
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with 1st wife 
2 CONT # Joseph Drake+ b. 24 Apr 1697, d. 12 Dec 1727
2 CONT # Benjamin Drake b. 14 Apr 1699
2 CONT # Ann Drake b. 30 Jan 1701
2 CONT # John Drake b. 6 May 1703
2 CONT # William Drake+ b. 30 Dec 1705, d. bt 23 Sep 1765 - 28 Apr 1767
2 CONT # Thomas Drake+ b. 18 May 1708, d. 10 Mar 1780
2 CONT # David Drake8 b. c 1710, d. 18 Mar 1793
2 CONT # Abell Drake b. 24 Mar 1710/11, d. 8 Aug 1747
2 CONT # Moses Drake b. 20 Jul 1716, d. 1744
2 CONT
2 CONT ------
2 CONT * http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~brouwergenealogydata/Drake/p24.htm#i6839
