1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 5. SAMUEL BARBER,2 (Thomas,1) bp. Oct. 1, 1648 ; m. 1st, Dec. 1, 1670, Mary Coggins, who. d. May 19, 1676. He m. 2nd, Jan. 25, 1677, Ruth Drake, dau. of John and Hannah (Moore) Drake, who was bp. Dec. 6, 1657.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Mary Coggins and Samuel Barber, born at Windsor:
2 CONT *28. i. Thomas, b. Oct. 7, 1671 ; buried Oct. 31, 1673. -|-
2 CONT *29. ii. Samuel, b. Jan. 26, 1673 ; m. Martha Ponder. 
2 CONT *30. III. John, probably d. young. (See explanation below)
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Cogan and Joan had four daughters all born in Taunton:
2 CONT
2 CONT #Bathsheba born about 1645; died at Springfield 1688; married John Barber
2 CONT #'''Mary''' born about 1647; died at Windsor, Ct.; married Samuel Barber, brother of the above mentioned
2 CONT #Martha born about 1648; died May 22nd, 1686 at Semsburgy, Ct., perhaps during childbirth; married Peter Buel
2 CONT #Ruth born about 1650-52; married Samuel Taylor
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
