2 CONC s]15. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had six children: John, Thomas, Sarah Hall, Samuel, Marcy Gillett, & Josiah. Source: Anderson's Great Migration Study Project,
2 CONT
2 CONT FINDaGRAVE contributor architype adds: She died the day before her husband Thomas. She is almost certainly interred at the same cemetery Palisado Cemetery: Windsor, Hartford, CT
2 CONT
