2 CONT *            Rebecca, daughter of John Barber, buried 6 Aug 1609
2 CONT *            Sara, daughter of John Barber, labourer, baptised 16 Sept 1610
2 CONT *            Thomas, son of John and Elizabeth Barber, baptised 25 Dec 1612
2 CONT *            All Saints Parish, Stamford
2 CONT *            Elizabeth LUMLEY, daughter of Thomas LUMLEY, baptised 4 August 1597 (How related?)
2 CONT *            Elizabeth, daughter of John Barber, baptised 10 or 11 Nov 1616
2 CONT *            John, son of John Barber, baptised 4 Aug 1620
2 CONT *            John Barber, buried 21 Apr 1620
2 CONT *            Elizabeth Barber, widow, buried 8 Mar 1632
2 CONT *            John Barber, son of Widow Barber, buried 22 Mar 1632
2 CONT *            Uffington Parish, Lincoln County  
2 CONT *            Elizabeth Barber m William FOWLER, 8 Jun 1590   (? related)
2 CONT *            Margaret Barber m John PREESTE, 2 Oct 1607     (? a sister of JohnA)
2 CONT *            John Barber m Elizabeth LUMLEY, 17 Oct 1608
2 CONT
2 CONT source:  THE BARBERS OF CONNECTICUT
