2 CONC 1708/9. iv Thomas HALE3, b 26 Aug 1672; m/1 Experience BURT; m/2 Mrs Abigail (WARNER) FERRY; r Springfield (Longmeadow). v Samuel HALE3, b 3 Jan 1673/4; d Suffield 1748; unmarried. vi Daughter3, b 28 Nov 1675; died young. vii Josi
