2 CONC MILLS; m/2 1704 Hannah CLARK (d 1798). iv Samuel GILLETT3, b 16 Feb 1677/78; d Suffield 1739; m Rebecca BANCROFT. v Benjamin (or Nathaniel) GILLETT3, b 3 Oct 1680; m Elizabeth AUSTIN; r Suffield. vi Mercy GILLETT3, b 31 Jan 1683/4
2 CONC ; d Suffield 1756; m Jacob ADAMS Jr. Children of Mary and George NORTON: vii Mary NORTON3, b 18 Jan 1684/5; m Jared HUXLEY. viii Abigail NORTON3, b 14 Dec 1686; d 21 Oct 1705. ix Freegrace NORTON3, b 1 Jan 1688/9; m Sarah MARTIN; 
2 CONC r Suffield. x Johanna NORTON3, b 17 Mar 1692/3; m Abraham ADAMS. xi Elizabeth NORTON3, b 31 Aug 1695; d 1 Aug 1697 (?). xii Elizabeth NORTON3, b 19 Mar 1696/7. She was born 4 months after her father died. 5 JOSIAH2, baptised 15 Fe
