2 CONC indsor 11 Sep 1662. Married at Windsor, 7 Oct 1640, Jane ____. She died at Windsor on 10 Sep 1662 as "[t]he wife of Thomas Bar Ber." In the inventory of Thomas Barber, taken 20 Oct 1662, his wives apparrel deceased was valued at [
2 CONC pounds]15. Source: Anderson's Great Migration Study Project
