1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Marriages
2 CONT # 8 Jul 1669 	at: Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut to John Gillette.  5 children 
2 CONT # 14 June 1683 at: Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut to George Norton; his 2nd wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Notes
2 CONT Mercy Barber was born 12 Oct 1651 Windsor, Hartford, CT.  She was the daughter of Thomas Barber & Jane (Joan) Coggins. After her parents' death when she was nine years old, Mercy was placed by the court in the home of Walter Fyler
2 CONC  until age 18, unless she married sooner. (She did). ''Genealogy of the Descendants of Thomas Barber of Windsor, CT''. pg. 2.
2 CONT
2 CONT In the Probate records in Hampshire Book 3 pages 36 37 is found the settlement of the estate of this Capt. George Norton dated March 31 1698. Mercy was his widow. burial should be changed to Old Centre Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Source
2 CONT "Gillette families (Gillet-Gillett-Gillette): Including some of the descendants of the immigrants Jonathan Gillet and Nathan Gillet, brothers from ... of Jonathan the immigrant, 1800-1955" by Bertha Bortle Beal Aldridge, p. 19)
2 CONT
