2 CONT ===James Barbour (abt. 1655 - 1732)===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT James Barbour
2 CONT
2 CONT Born about 1655 in Dorchester, Suffolk, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Thomas Barbour and Jane Bancroft
2 CONT
2 CONT [sibling(s) unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Elizabeth (Ide) Barbour — married 1683 in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Experience Barbour, Elizabeth (Barbour) Hayward, James Barbour, Patience Barber, Robert Barbour and Ebenezer Barbour
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 13 Oct 1732 in Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT 21:16: Teri (Peters) Sheldon added James Barbour (abt.1655-1732) as father of Patience Barber (1689-abt.1735). [Thank Teri for this]
2 CONT
