2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Samuel Barber and Ruth Drake, born at Windsor:
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT v MARY3 "Mercy", b 1680; d 27 Aug 1719; m Windsor 22 Jul 1696 Peter BROWN, b Windsor 12 Mar 1666/7,d there 6 Mar 1739, son of Peter and Mary (GILLETTE) BROWN; r Windsor. Mary died on the born. Peter was perhaps a grandson of Peter
2 CONC  BROWN of Plymouth MA, and of the Mayflower; however, the Mayflower Society thinks there is not enough proof to allow this connection, and will not allow this to be a valid connection. [~ Corresp:Arthur K Gibson; CT Hist Soc:Brown
2 CONC  Manuscript; Corresp:Carl Jordan; Corresp:Bob Seger ~]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Mary and Peter, born at Windsor:
2 CONT * i Peter BROWN4, b 28 Jan 1699/1700; probably the Peter BROWN who m 14 Aug 1722 Rachel SCOTT; r Windsor.
2 CONT * ii Dinah BROWN4, b 4 Jan 1701/2; m Dea. Thomas POST; r Hebron.
2 CONT * iii Samuel BROWN4, b 28 Aug 1705; m Mary PHELPS; r Windsor.
2 CONT * iv Mary BROWN4, b 28 Aug 1708; m Joseph SEGER III. Joseph m/1 Mehitable PARSONS.
2 CONT * v Benjamin BROWN4, b 11 Aug 1711; m/1 Hannah GRANT; m/2 1760 Widow Mary BROWN (probably the widow of Daniel BROWN); m/3 Hannah ‑‑‑; r Windsor.
2 CONT * vi Ebenezer BROWN4, b 27 Aug 1719
2 CONT * vii Mindwell BROWN4, twin, b 27 Aug 1719; d Springfield MA 25 Feb 1758; unmarried.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Date and place of birth have also been (erroneously?) reported to be:
2 CONT
2 CONT * March 12, 1666 at Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut
2 CONT * March 12, 1667 at Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Date and place of death have also been (erroneously?) reported to be March 6, 1739 at Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut.
