2 CONT Served In the revolutionary War 9 months.
2 CONT First wife Abigail Taylor married about 1780, and a grave stone next to Lt. Ellis Bliss is inscribed with what appears to be his second wife "Thankful wife of Ellis Bliss" married about 1799.
