1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Mary Jordan Post=
2 CONT * BIRTH 1643 Guilford, New Haven County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 23 Mar 1683 (aged 39–40) Saybrook Point, Middlesex County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Burial Details Unknown 
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 84897360  
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Notes==  
2 CONT * Mary's birth year is estimated. She may have been born a little earlier but probably not much later than 1643.
2 CONT * I would contend that Mary must be buried in an unmarked grave in the Cypress Cemetery which is the oldest cemetery in Old Saybrook and has a tradition stating there were unmarked graves for the early settlers.
2 CONT
