1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Abner Post (1783–1855) was a resident of Connecticut and the husband of Sarah Gilbert. He was the son of Phinehas Post and is documented in various historical records, including the 1850 United States Census. 
2 CONT Key Biographical Details
2 CONT Birth: 1783, Connecticut.
2 CONT Death: 1855.
2 CONT Spouse: He married Sarah Gilbert, with whom he had at least two children:
2 CONT Sarah Maria Post.
2 CONT Mary Esther Post.
2 CONT
2 CONT Genealogical Context
2 CONT The Post family has deep roots in early American history, particularly in Connecticut (specifically Saybrook and Hebron). Many members of the Post lineage, including ancestors like Stephen Post (1604–1659), were among the early se
2 CONC ttlers of the Hartford and Old Saybrook areas.
