1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 196. Hon. Alexander Phelps, b. Hebron, Ct., 6 Jan., 1723-4, m. 1st Mrs, Anna Phelps, a widow, 20 Jan., 1749. She d. Hebron, Ct., 13th Apr., 1750. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He m, 2nd Theodora Wheelock, 9 Feb., 1751, daughter of the Rev. Elea- zer Wheelock, and possibly a widow.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children by 1st wife, b. Hebron, Ct.:
2 CONT *Theodora, b. 9 Apr., 1750, d. 15 Apr -' I750 - twin 
2 CONT *Anna, b. 9 Apr., 1750, d. 15 Apr., 1750 - twin 
2 CONT
