2 CONT Theodora (Wheelock) Young (1736 - abt. 1811)
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Theodora (Thea) Young formerly Wheelock aka Phelps==
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 23 May 1736 in Lebanon, New Haven, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Eleazar Wheelock and Sarah (Davenport) Wheelock
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Elizabeth (Maltby) Betts [half], John Maltby [half], William Maltby [half], Sarah Maltby [half], William Maltby [half], Mary Maltby [half], Eleazar Wheelock, Ruth (Wheelock) Patten, Ralph Rodolphus Wheelock, Mary (Wheelo
2 CONC ck) Woodward [half], Abigail (Wheelock) Ripley [half], John Wheelock [half], Eleazar Wheelock [half] and James Wheelock [half]
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Alexander Phelps — married 9 Feb 1751 in Hebron, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of John Virgil Young — married 27 Apr 1777 in Hanover, Grafton, NH
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Anne Phelps, Sarah Phelps, Theodotia Phelps, Davenport Phelps and Polly Young
2 CONT
2 CONT Died about 1811 in Piermont, Grafton, New Hampshire, United States
