2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne emigrated to America on the John & Mary in May 39, 1630 with husband William & Children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne DOVER - d. Aug. 30, 1689, Windsor, CT - recorded as "Mrs. An Phelps died." A passenger on the 'Mary & John,' and first on the list of women members of the church at Dorchester.
2 CONT
