2 CONT **Timothy PHELPS, son
2 CONT **Mary PHELPS, daughter All the surviving ones migrated to New England:  William, 2nd wife Anne, and his kids: William, Samuel, Nathaniel, Joseph.  The last 3 - Sarah, Timothy, & Mary were born in New England.  Submitted by [[Phel
