2 CONT Emigrated to New England in the Ship "Mary and John" commanded by Captain Squeb.  Sailed from Plymouth England, March 20th 1630 and arrived in Nautasket (now Hull, Mass.) on May 30th 1630.  This company settled/founded Dorchester,
2 CONC  Mass.
2 CONT
