2 CONT ==Notes on DNA Findings==Several descendants of William Phelps have DNA-tested through FTDNA.  This William is from Crewkerne, Somerset Co., England.  He was probably born in Dorset or in Yeovil area, Somerset Co.  We are still tr
2 CONC ying to find relatives in England and ask them to participate in the yDNA Phelps surname project through FTDNA.  
