2 CONC ddition, Supplement to Torrey's New England Marriages Prior to 1700, pg 59 states "PHELPS, William-1 (c1592-1672) & 2/wf Anne DOVER (-1675); m 14 Nov 1626 Crewkerne, co Somerset [TAG 65:163]".
