2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT This is the FIRST MARY PHELPS of three Mary Phelpses born to William PHELPS and his 2nd wife Anne DOVER.  She was a twin with Joseph Phelps who survived.(NOTE:  The first two Marys died in infancy, the third one lived to adulthood
2 CONC  and had children).  Submitted by [[Phelps-191  | Dorothy Phelps]], Monday, September 15, 2014.
2 CONT The first Mary Phelps was born on 13 Nov 1628 in Crewkerne, Somerset, England with her twin brother Joseph Phelps.  She was buried on 29 Nov1628 in Crewkerne, Somerset, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Please check her father William Phelps' Bio/Sources for more info.
2 CONT
