2 CONT Thomas Barber married Mary Phelps, the daughter of William Phelps, Sr. and Mary Dover Phelps, on December 17, 1663. Mary Phelps was born on March 2, 1644, in Windsor; when her husband died on May 10, 1713, she and five of their ei
2 CONC ght children shared his estate. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Barber is buried in the Hopmeadow Cemetery near the site of the now lost meetinghouse.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Thomas and Mary Phelps Barber
2 CONT * 1. John (born 1 November 1, 1664; married Mary Holcomb; died 1 March 1, 1711/12)
2 CONT * 2. Marcy also called Mary (born January 11, 1666)
2 CONT * 3. Sarah (born July 12, 1669; married Lieutenant Andrew Robe) 
2 CONT * 4. Joanna (born 1670; married first Josiah Adkins; married second Benjamin Colt)
2 CONT * 5. Annie (born 1671; married Jonathan Higley died November 15, 1722)
2 CONT * 6. Thomas, Jr. (born October 7, 1672; married Abigail Buel; died 17 Jul 17, 1714)
2 CONT * 7. Samuel (born May 17, 1673; married Sarah Holcomb; died December 18, 1725) 
2 CONT * 8. Infant (born 1677)
