2 CONT *John G. Hunt, "Note on the Ancestry of the Griswolds of Connecticut," in The American Genealogist, 40:43 
2 CONT *Killingworth Vital Records pg. 79 - GRISWOLD MARGARET w. Edward d: 23 Aug 1670
