2 CONC  for Margaret(PID https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/4:1:MJFK-SCQ); contributed by various users. Jordan, John W. Genealogical and Personal History of Western Pennsylvania (Lewis Historical Pub. Co., New York, 1915, Vol. 3. pg. 1
2 CONC 707-1711)
