2 CONT
2 CONT Ancestor of Longfellow
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Wadsworth LONGFELLOW (1807-1882), poet (The Village Blacksmith,1841; Evangeline, 1847; The Song of Hiawatha,1855; The Courtship of Miles Standish, 1858; Paul Revere's Ride, 1860; and others) and college professor at Bowdoin 
2 CONC (1829-1835) and Harvard (1835-1854), graduated Bowdoin College 1825, married first in 1831 to Mary Storer POTTER, and second in 1843 to Frances APPLETON.
2 CONT
2 CONT Stephen LONGFELLOW IV (1776-1849) and Zilpah WADSWORTH (1778-1851) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gen. Peleg WADSWORTH Jr. (1748-1829) and Elizabeth BARTLETT (1753-1825) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel BARTLETT (1696-1769) and Elizabeth LOTHROP (c1718-1793) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph BARTLETT, Jr. (c1665-1703) and Lydia GRISWOLD (1671-1752) 
2 CONT
