1 NOTE {geni:about_me} This is the first daughter of Edward and Margaret Griswold named Sarah. There was a second Sarah born 1638, who married (1) Samuel Phelps and (2) Nathaniel Pinney. Please see: The Griswold family, England-America :
2 CONC  Edward of Windsor, Connecticut, Matthew of Lyme, Connecticut, Michael of Wethersfield, Connecticut by Griswold, Glenn E; https://archive.org/details/griswoldfamilyen02gris/page/16 (Steven Ferry, February 8, 2019.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah died in infancy.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah was born in 1631. Sarah is the child of Edward Griswold and Margaret.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Note:  Died young according to Griswold book.  I've seen the two Sarahs confused on web pages but it makes since the first one had died therefore they named another daughter Sarah.
2 CONT
