2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT ==Biography==Deborah Griswold, daughter of Edward Griswold, immigrant, who was bornin Kenilworth England 1607 and married in 1630 Margaret Hicks (1607 to August 23, 1679), was born at Windsor Connecticut June 28, 1648, married Sam
2 CONC uel Buel Nov 18, 1662 at Windsor, and d. February 7, 1719 at  Killingworth (Kenilworth) Connecticut.
2 CONT Deborah is considered the ancestral mother of all Buells in Killingworth, all Buells east of the Connecticut River, and all the Buells of Litchfield, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT === Birth ===
2 CONT : Deborah was born in 1646.  : Birth 18 JUN 1646 Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut : Birth 28 JUN 1646 Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut : Christening 28 JUN 1646, Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut : Deborah Buell was baptized 28 Jun 1646 
2 CONC in Windsor : Death 7 FEB 1717/8 Killingworth, Middlesex, Connecticut
