2 CONT Noah Phelps was born in 1694 in Hebron, Connecticut, to Timothy Phelpsand [[Crow-9 |Martha (Crow) Phelps]].<ref name = "Phelps and Servin Book">Oliver Seymour Phelps and Andrew Tinkey Servin, The Phelps Familyof America and Their 
2 CONC English Ancestors : With Copies of Wills, Deeds,Letters, and Other Interesting Papers, Coats of Arms and Valuable Records, Volume I, pp. 107-108  (Eagle Publishing Co., Pittsfield 1899). ''Copy available at'' https://archive.org/d
2 CONC etails/phelpsfamilyofam01phel.</ref> Noah married Ann Dyer in 1719.<ref name = "Phelps and Servin Book" /> The couple settled in Hebron and had nine known children, including Noah Phelps, Jr., Barrett (Phelps) Bigelow, Elijiah Phe
2 CONC lps, Mary (Phelps) Rollo, Hannah (Phelps) Sackett, Anna (Phelps) Gilbert, James Phelps,Abijah Phelps, and Asa (Phelps) Bronson.<ref name = "Phelps and Servin Book" />  Later, Noah moved to Hillsdale, Columbia County, New York.<ref
2 CONC  name = "Phelps and Servin Book" />  Noah lived to be one hundred, passing away in 1794.<ref name = "Phelps and Servin Book" /> 
2 CONT
2 CONT === Sources ===
