1 NOTE !One record gives d d as 1757, at Culchester, Ct., but appears to be incorrect, as he was said to die at age 100 years, while living with his children. From "In Search of the Passengers of the Mary  & John 1630", Vol 7, page 74. H
2 CONC ad 9 children as follows; Noah, Jr., b 21 Nov 1720, d 10 June 1795, 10 chi. Barrett 20 Sept 1722, Hebron, Ct d 1789, 15 Chi. Elijah 31 July 1724, Hebron, 11 chi.   From this we see Noah Mary 1 May 1726, Hebron, 7 chi.             
2 CONC              and Ann had at least Hannah, on our pedigree, 12 chi.                         59 grand children. Annah 1 Feb1730 1 chi James, Capt., 1732, Hebron d 10 Mar 1831, 7 chi. Abijah 8 Mar 1734, 6 chi, and Asa.
2 CONT
2 CONT Noah Phelps may have died in Hillsdale, Columbia, NY.
