2 CONT == Biography =='''disambiguation''':  See also [[Phelps-58|Cornelius Phelps]] b. Windsor, Ct,, 26 April, 1671, m, Sarah Mansfield
2 CONT "Corneliass" Phelps was born in Hebron, Connecticut to Timothy Phelps on 5 March 1698. <ref>[[#birth|Barbour Collection]]</ref>  He married Margaret Dewey, the daughter of Nathaniel and Margaret (Burrows) Dewey.  The marriage was 
2 CONC recorded in Lebanon, Connecticut on 18 January 1721/2.  They settled in Hebron and Cornelius died there 15 or 16 August 1760, in his 63rd year.
2 CONT ===== Children =====
2 CONT All born in Hebron, Connecticut:
2 CONT * Margaret Phelps, b. 11 December 1722, m. Amos Fuller
2 CONT * Farry Phelps, b. 8 November 1724, died young
2 CONT * Cornelius Phelps, b. 16 July 1726, m. Hannah Calkins
2 CONT * Sylvanus Phelps, b. 28 May 1729, m. Zermia Swartland
2 CONT * Jeremiah Phelps, b. 13 January 1732, m. Prudence Phelps
2 CONT * Tamar Phelps, b. February 1734, m. Elijah Buell on 15 April 1756
2 CONT * Naomi Phelps, b. 26 August 1736, m. Samuel Palmer on 15 April 1756* Libe (or Lydia) Phelps, b. 2 July 1739, m. Frederick Morrison on 9 February 1763
2 CONT * Theodora Phelps, b. 10 July 1741
2 CONT * Judith Phelps, b. 26 October 1743
2 CONT
