2 CONT 6595. Abigail Burr. Born ca 1702 in Hartford, CT. Abigail was baptized in Hartford, CT, on 25 Oct 1702.87 Abigail died on 4 Sep 1760 in Hartford, CT.87 Ca 1723 Abigail married Capt. Timothy Phelps (20698) , son of Timothy Phelps (
2 CONC 7815) (26 Oct 1656-bef 29 Apr 1712) & Sarah Pratt (ca 1662-18 Feb 1758). Born on 24 May 1702 in Hartford, CT. Timothy was baptized in Hartford, CT, on 31 May 1702. Timothy died on 9 Sep 1756; he was 54.
