1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Phelps, Sr. was born in 1703 in Windsor, Connecticut, to Joseph Phelps (b. 1666) and Sarah (Hosford) Phelps (b. 1666). [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT John and Anna Hosford wed in 1725.[1] Anna passed away in 1740, and John remarried to Mindwell Hosford (who was Anna's sister).[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT John and Anna's children include Aaron (1728/9 to 1743), Anna, John, Sarah, Amos, and Roger.[1] John and Mindwell's children include Aaron (b. 1743), Mindwell, Sarah, and Nathan.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT John passed away in Hebron, Connecticut in 1769.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT ==References 
