1 NOTE {geni:about_me} David Porter, son of John Porter & Joanna Gaylord, born Oct 1685.
2 CONT
2 CONT His birthday is listed variously as 10 Oct in The Descendants of John Porter, By H.P. Andrews[1] and 3 Oct in FamilySearch "Connecticut Births and Christenings, 1649-1906"[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Anna Phelps on 3 Jan 1707.[1]. She was Born 2 Oct 1686 to Capt. Timothy & Mary (Griswold) Phelps.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died Jan 24 1767, age 81 [3]
