2 CONT Brief Life History of Jerusha
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jerusha Porter was born on 15 September 1712, in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut, United States, her father, David Porter, was 26 and her mother, Anne Phelps, was 25. She married Thomas Perrin on 14 February 1738, in Hebron, T
2 CONC olland, Connecticut, United States. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 4 daughters. She died on 23 May 1754, in Hebron, Tolland, Connecticut, United States, at the age of 41.
