1 NOTE {geni:about_me} . She married Samuel Thompson, III 29 Oct 1744 in Goshen, Litchfield, CT, but she is recorded there as "not of Goshen." Indeed, no Holcombs seem to be of record in Goshen at that time. Yet family genealogists who a
2 CONC ctually knew her as an old woman, referred to her as "Sarah of Goshen." -courtesy Linda Maclachlan] 
