1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/22104678/abigail-baker
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail was the dau. and first b. child of John Bissell and Abigail Filley, b. at Windsor, Conn. on Aug. 3, 1681 [Matthew Grant Record & Windsor TR]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT On Dec. 26, 1706 at Windsor, Conn., Abigail m. as his 2nd wife, Joseph Baker, Jr., s. of Joseph Baker and Hannah Cook of Windsor. After their children were b. at Windsor, the family relocated to Tolland, Conn. where her husband an
2 CONC d several of the children are interred with gravestones at Tolland's South Yard cemetery. Abigail survived her husband and at her death was apparently living with daughter Hannah (Baker) Gurley at Mansfield, Conn.
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail's gravestone says she d. "in the 88th year of her age," the long-hand form for she died Ætatis suæ (i.e., Æ, "Aged," in the XX year of her Age) 88. However, if the inscribed date of her death is correct, based on her recor
2 CONC ded date of birth (3 Aug. 1681) Abigail was 85 years old at death and Ætatis suæ 86, not 88.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Not the same as her aunt:
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=51098382
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Bissell and Abigail Holcomb had the following ten children b. of record in Windsor, Conn.:
2 CONT
2 CONT • ii. Abigail Bissell, b. July 6, 1661, d. testate either at Simsbury or Windsor, Conn. in April 1728, Æ 67; m. Dec. 26, 1678 in Windsor, her mother's step-brother, James Eno, Jr., s. of James Eno, Sr. and his first wife Anna, b. 
2 CONC Oct 30, 1651 in Windsor. He d. testate July 16, 1714 in Windsor, Æ 63. Nine children of the family.
2 CONT
2 CONT Therefore, Granddaughter of John (1) Bissell and his first wife; and Thomas and Elizabeth Holcomb
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-247519271-1-315/mrs-abigail-stiles-baker-born-bissell-in-myheritage-family-trees?indId=externalindividual-441b835997acc43f53324dbc3ac4753c&mrid=b561cc082ed6e4ab13c9b19ceff
