2 CONT === Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT WikiTree contributors, "John Root IV (1672-1731)," WikiTree: The Free Family Tree, (https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Root-365 : accessed 09 September 2025).
2 CONT
2 CONT John Root IV was born in 1672 [1] in Westfield, Hampshire, Massachusetts Bay Colony, noting father John Root. [2] p. 317
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Sarah Stebbins on 8 Jan 1701 in Springfield [2] p. 321[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT #Their daughter Sarah was chirtened on 5 Jul 1702 [4]
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife Sarah passed away in 1713 and he remarried widow Elizabeth Sackett in Sep 1713 [2] p. 321.
2 CONT
2 CONT #They christenened their son Moses Root in 1717 [5]
2 CONT
2 CONT He passed away 1 May 1731 in Westfield, Hampden, Massachusetts Bay Colony [2][6]
2 CONT
