2 CONT Summary:	The article discusses the Root family's history in Westfield, Massachusetts, including marriages, births, and deaths from multiple generations. The article highlights John Root's lineage, from his father John Root of Badb
2 CONC y, England, to his own children and grandchildren in Westfield. It also mentions Rev. Edward Taylor and Isaak Phelps, colleagues in religious leadership. The article details various family relationships, including grandparent conn
