2 CONT March 6, 1753, "Rachel Pettibone, alias Moore, and her husband, David Moore, executors to the last will and testiment of Stephen Petibone, Jr.," exhibited an account of debts against the estate which they had paid. Stephen Pettibo
2 CONC ne, Jr., m. Rachel Segar June 5, 1744, and died Dec. n, 1750. This wife must have been the mother of David's 3 younger children.
