1 OCCU Married Chauncy Warriner 2/10/1848 At Winter Qarters, Nebraska, and had 11 children.  She was a Utah Pioneer in 1850.
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Priscilla Strong Porter was born on December 11, 1830, at Wyoming, Sheldon County, New York, to Ezra Strong and Olive Lowell.  Priscilla Strong married Chauncy Warriner Porter on February 10, 1848, at Winter Quarte
2 CONC rs, (Florence), Douglas, Nebraska. She was a Utah Pioneer in 1850.
2 CONT
