2 CONT
2 CONT Female - Olive Martha Porter, Born: 29 Apr 1866, Place: Hardscrabble, Porterville, Morgan, Utah, Died: 16 Mar 1867, Buried: Mar 1867 
2 CONT
2 CONT Male -  Melvin Omer Porter, Born: 11 Jun 1858, Place: Springville, Utah, Utah, Died: 10 Jun 1879, Place: Manti, Sanpete, Utah, Buried: Jun 1879 
2 CONT
