2 CONT
2 CONT Male - Francis Lysander Porter, Born: 4 Jul 1854, Place: Mill Creek, Salt Lake City, Salt Lake, Utah, Died: 1 Apr 1915, Place: Kingston, Piute, Utah, Buried: 4 Apr 1915, Place: Kingston, Piute, Ut
2 CONT
2 CONT Female - Mary Etta Porter, Born: 5 Jul 1856, Place: Centerville, Davis, Utah, Died: 5 May 1917, Place: Iona, Bonneville, Idaho, Buried: 8 May 1916 Place: Iona, Bonneville, Idaho
2 CONT
2 CONT Female - Printha Priscilla Porter, Born: 29 Aug 1852, Place: Millcreek, Salt Lake, Utah, Christened: 29 Aug 1852, Place: Millcreek, Salt Lake, Utah, Died: 18 Oct 1927, Place: Hillsboro, Washington Co., Oregon,  Buried: October, 19
2 CONC 27
2 CONT
