2 CONT Priscilla Strong Porter lived in the following locations; Wyoming, Sheldon County New York, Winter Quarters, Florence, Douglas County, Nebraska, Porterville, Morgan County, Utah, Millcreek, Salt Lake County, Utah, Springville, Uta
2 CONC h County, Utah, Centerville, Davis County, Utah and Orderville, Kane County, Utah.
2 CONT
2 CONT Priscilla Strong Porter died on Jan. 9, 1895 at Orderville, Kane County, Utah. She was buried on Jan. 12, 1895 at Orderville, Kane County, Utah.
