2 CONT *Civil War Veteran
2 CONT Joseph served as a 2Lieutenant with the 9 Michigan Infantry Company-E. He enlisted on September 12, 1861. He was promoted on April 28, 1862 to Corporal. He reenlisted on December 25, 1863 and again was promoted on December 28, 186
2 CONC 3 to Sergeant. He was promoted two more times on October 16, 1864 to 1Sergeant and again on October 26, 1864 to 2Lieutenant. He was discharged on July 31, 1865.
2 CONT He later married Emma D.Pemberton on July 22, 1867.
