2 CONT Rev. Charles Chauncy was christened on 5 November 1592 at Yardley, Hertfordshire, England.6,1,2,3 He married Catherine Eyre, daughter of Robert Eyre, Esq. and Anne Still, on 17 March 1631 at Ware, Hertfordshire, England; They had 
2 CONC 6 sons (Isaac; Ichabod; Barnabus; Nathaniel; Elnathan; & Israel) and 2 daughters (Sarah, wife of Gershom Bulkeley; & Hannah).6,1,2,3 Rev. Charles Chauncy died on 19 February 1672 at Cambridge, Middlesex, MA, at age 79.7,6,2,3
