2 CONT *Wilson's Dissenting Churches, i. 289–91; 
2 CONT *Will reg. in P.C.C. 46, Barnes.
2 CONT *Charles Chauncy (Wikipedia): https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charles_Chauncy
