2 CONT Rev. Peter Bulkeley  Birth: 31 JAN 1582/83 in Odell or Woodhill, Bedfordshire, England.  Death: 9 MAR 1659 in Concord, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT Note:  B.A., St. John's College, Cambridge,. 1604/5, M.A. 1608, ordained Deacon and priest June 1608, Canon of Lichfield 1609, University preacher 1610. Married (1) at Goldington, Bedforshire 12 Apr. 1613, Jane Allen, da. of Thoma
2 CONC s Allen, Gent., by Mary Fairclough. They had 7 sons.
2 CONT
2 CONT Douglas Richardson, _Plantagenet Ancestry_, p. 163-65
2 CONT
2 CONT Rev. Peter Bulkeley, 50, of Odell, county Bedford, Mrs. Grace Bulkeley, 30, John Bulkeley, 15, Benjamin Bulkeley, 11, Daniel Bulkeley, 9, Priscilla Jarman, 10, Elizabeth Taylor, 10, and Anne Lieford, 13, were on the list of passen
2 CONC gers on the SUSAN AND ELLEN, Edward Payne, Master. She sailed in May, but the date of her arrival is not of record. No certificates of residence accompanied this list. (The Planters of The Commonwealth in Massachusetts, 1620-1640,
2 CONC  page 134)
2 CONT
