2 CONC ll, Bedfordshire, England c: 13 APR 1617 in Odell, Bedfordshire, England 4. Nathaniel BULKELEY b: BEF 29 NOV 1618 in Odell, Bedfordshire, England c: 29 NOV 1618 in Odell, Bedfordshire, England (* William BULKEY b: ABT 1619 in Prin
2 CONC ce George, MD or Westham Essex England......*Questionable) 5. John BULKELEY b: 17 FEB 1620 in Odell, Bedfordshire, England c: 6 FEB 1620 in Odell, Bedfordshire, England 6. Mary BULKELEY b: BEF 1 NOV 1621 in Odell, Bedfordshire, En
2 CONC gland 7. Joseph BULKELEY b: BEF 4 MAY 1623 in Odell, Bedfordshire, England c: 4 MAY 1623 in Odell, Bedfordshire, England (?) George BULKELEY b: 17 MAY 1623 in Odell, Bedfordshire, England 8. Daniel BULKELEY b: BEF 28 AUG 1625 in O
