2 CONT Matthew Jones Born about 1628 [location unknown] Son of [father unknown] and [mother unknown] [sibling(s) unknown] Husband of Ann (Griggs) Jones — married [date unknown] [location unknown] Father of Sarah (Jones) Prentice Died [da
2 CONC te unknown] in Boston, Massachusetts [uncertain] Profile managers: Rick Parrott  [send private message] and Daniel Jacobsen  [send private message] Last profile change on 28 September 2014 17:46: Anne B posted a message on the pag
2 CONC e for Matthew Jones. [Thank Anne for this] This page has been accessed 131 times.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nominate for Profile of the Week by posting the link http://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Jones-4685 in our G+ Community. Vote by clicking the +1 button above. "Jones, MATTHEW, Boston, by w. Ann had Rebecca, b. 26 Feb. 1645; Matthew; and 
2 CONC Sarah, a. 1660; rem. to New London, where Sarah m. John Prentice."[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT It has been disproven that Matthew of Boston was the husband of Ann Griggs, the mother of Matthew and Sarah, who went to New London. See profile Ann Griggs Jones Latimer. In addition Matthew the son of Matthew died in infancy.
2 CONT
2 CONT These items seem to refer to Matthew Jones and Ann "unknown":
2 CONT
2 CONT William of Matthew & Ann Jyons died 1st -- 9th month. 1654[2] Ann of Matthew Jones 11 day 4 mo. (First Church baptism) 1654. & Anna of Matthew & Ann Jyons died 26th -- 5th month. 1654[2] Catharine of Matthias & Ann Jions born 1st 
2 CONC June. 1655[2] Matthew of Matthew & Ann Jions died 13th --- 3rd month. 1656[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Rebecca's record as mentioned in Savage, has not been located.
2 CONT
