2 CONT NOTE
2 CONT
2 CONT This profile was set as a PPP so that she would not be merged with her cousin, who also married John Prentice.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1st wife Hester Nichols - Stratford Fairfield, Connecticut. Daughter of John Nichols and Grace (unknown). Married John Prentis around 1651. Mother of most of the children.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2nd wife Esther Nichols - New London County, Connecticut, USA. Daughter of Caleb Nichols and Anne Ward. Second wife of John Prentice, married in 1680 a year after his first wife Hester Nichols died.
2 CONT
2 CONT These two women are often thought of as the same person but in fact were first cousins (fathers were brothers). Esther was the mother of Valentine Prentice b. 1681.
2 CONT
