2 CONC  Hester (Nichols) Prentice — married about 1651 in Connecticut Husband of Esther (Nichols) Prentice — married about 1680 in Connecticut Husband of Rebecca Parker — married 1685 [location unknown] Father of John Prentice, Joseph Pr
2 CONC entice (1), Jonathan Prentice, Esther (Prentice) Gallup, Peter Prentice, Stephen Prentice, Mercy (Prentiss) Prentice, Hannah (Prentice) Frink, Elizabeth (Prentice) Comstock, Thomas Prentice, Valentine Prentice, Valentine Prentice 
2 CONC and	Valentine Prentis Died 1691 in New London, New London, Connecticut Profile managers: A Fabry  [send private message], Rick Parrott  [send private message], Lamar Ross  [send private message], Maureen Foss  [send private messag
