1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thomas Esq. Hosmer (b. 28 Oct 1701, d. 22 Jan 1777)
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Esq. Hosmer (son of Thomas Capt. Hosmer and Ann Prentiss) was born 28 Oct 1701 in Hartford, CT, and died 22 Jan 1777 in West Hartford, CT. He married Susannah Steel on 18 Jul 1734 in West Hartford, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Thomas Esq. Hosmer and Susannah Steel: Marriage: 18 Jul 1734, West Hartford, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Thomas Esq. Hosmer and Susannah Steel are: Susannah Hosmer, b. 24 May 1737, d. 08 Mar 1812. Thomas Hosmer, b. 01 Apr 1739, d. 01 May 1835. Deborah Hosmer, b. 06 Apr 1741, d. 15 Sep 1776. Eldad Hosmer, b. 22 Apr 1743, d
2 CONC . 22 Sep 1820. Ruth Hosmer, b. 20 Sep 1744, d. 25 Jan 1818. Daniel Hosmer, b. 1749, d. 29 Apr 1800, West Hartford, CT. Jerusha Hosmer, b. 18 Oct 1749, d. 27 Apr 1783. Elisha Hosmer, b. 01 Apr 1753, d. 1799. +Simeon Hosmer, b. 07 M
2 CONC ay 1754, Hartford, CT, d. 09 Dec 1831, Elba, Genesse County, NY. Ashbel Hosmer, b. 30 Apr 1758, West Hartford, CT, d. 02 Apr 1812.
