1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/108325502/person/161002361284 Ancestry Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''May 9 2018, 13:47:36 UTC''
