2 CONT
2 CONT Dinah Merry was born on October 14, 1777 at West Hartford, Connecticut to Ebenezer Jr. and Sarah Whiting Merry. She married David Markham about 1795 at Avon, New York. They had the following children: Dinah Markham (died at four y
2 CONC ears old), Nathaniel Markham and Stephen Markham.
2 CONT
2 CONT During the winter of 1788-1789 the family moved to Rush, New York from Connecticut via New Hampshire and settled there. In the midst of some celebrating in July 1801, in Rush, New York there was an accidental shooting that resulte
2 CONC d in the death of her husband David Markham.
2 CONT
2 CONT Now she was left alone with two young sons, Nathaniel (b 22 Aug. 1798) and infant brother, Stephen (b 9 Feb. 1800). In time, she married Samuel Kelsey and a daughter, Sarah, was born near Buffalo on 28 May, 1805. Kelsey died about
2 CONC  two years later.
2 CONT
2 CONT "We came to Mentor, Ohio, on horseback, accompanied by Ebenezer Mather of Mentor," Sarah wrote in 1889. "He rode on one horse with my two brothers, one in front and one behind. My mother rode another horse and carried me in her ar
2 CONC ms... There were no roads, only marked trails and nights were spent in settlers' cabins. We resided several months in Mentor then my mother married Samuel Potter of Unionville and we moved into his comfortable log house." Dinah ha
2 CONC d five more children: Samuel, Whiting, Elizabeth, Lucy and Edward.
2 CONT
2 CONT Some info by Mrs. Julia Markham Crow.
2 CONT -----------------
2 CONT Married 1) David Markham, about 1795, Avon, N. Y. 2) Samuel Kelsey, 28 Apr 1804, Livingston, N.Y. 3) Samuel Potter, 14 Mar 1810, Mentor, Ohio
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with David Markham: Dinah Markham (died an infant), Nathaniel and Stephen Markham
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with Samuel Kelsey: Sarah Kelsey Woodworth
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with Samuel Potter: Samuel Potter, Whiting Potter, Elizabeth Potter, Lucy Potter and Edward Potter
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Members Parents Ebenezer Merry 1748– 1809
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Horner Whiting Merry 1750– 1822
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouses David Markham 1771– 1801 (m. 1795)
2 CONT
2 CONT Photo Samuel Potter 1779– 1850 (m. 1810)
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings Photo Hosmer Merry 1783– 1855
2 CONT
