1 NAME Hosmer /Merry/
2 GIVN Hosmer
2 SURN Merry
2 _MARNM Merry
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Bloomingville Cemetery
2 ADDR
3 CITY Bloomingville
3 STAE Ohio
3 CTRY United States
1 BIRT
