1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Derk Daniels Kotter''' was born circa June 29, 1797 in Veendam, Groningen, Nederland and was baptized on June 29, 1797 in Veendam, Veendam, GR, Netherlands. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-91605880 Daniel Hindrik
2 CONC s Hendriks Kotter] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-91543438 Trijntje Derks Langebruik]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Derk married [https://www.geni.com/profile-52510183 Grietje Hindriks Jonker] on February 25, 1820 in Veendam, Veendam, GR, Netherlands. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Derk married [https://www.geni.com/profile-52510185 Cijke Jans Hazewinkel] on November 13, 1831 in Veendam, Veendam, GR, Netherlands. 
2 CONT ----
