1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Trijntje Daniëls Kotter''' was born on December 2, 1801 in Veendam, Groningen, Nederland. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-91605880 Daniel Hindriks Hendriks Kotter] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-91543438 Trijn
2 CONC tje Derks Langebruik]. She was a Landbouwster. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Trijntje married [https://www.geni.com/profile-51953541 Jan Manuels Hindriks Jonker] on May 17, 1824 in Veendam, Veendam, GR, Netherlands. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Trijntje married [https://www.geni.com/profile-51952636 Albert Jakobs Zuiderweg] on June 17, 1839 in Veendam, Veendam, GR, Netherlands. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-52508746 Albert Zuider
2 CONC weg]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-51952829 Hinderikus Zuiderweg]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-52508806 Markus Alberts Zuiderweg]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died circa February 4, 1883 in Nieuwe Pekela?. 
2 CONT ----
