1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Hindrikje Hindriks Pot''' was born on June 30, 1819 in Ommelanderwijk, gem. Veendam. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-52508718 Hindrik Hindriks Pot] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-52508738 Fokkien Bloeiveld]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hindrikje married [https://www.geni.com/profile-51952650 Derk Alberts Zuiderweg] on November 25, 1844 in Veendam. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-52508674 Albert Zuiderweg]; [https://www.gen
2 CONC i.com/profile-51952652 Fokkien Zuiderweg]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-52508663 Elisabeth Zuiderweg]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on January 16, 1890 in Wildervank. 
2 CONT ----
