1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Eilderdina Hindriks Strating''' was born on April 20, 1825 in Onstwedde. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-52508790 Hindrik Eilders Strating] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-52508791 Geertje Geerts Sterenborg]. S
2 CONC he was a zb. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Eilderdina married [https://www.geni.com/profile-51952627 Hindrik Alberts Zuiderweg] on August 26, 1854 in Oude Pekela. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-52509517 Albert Zuiderweg]; [https://w
2 CONC ww.geni.com/profile-52508681 Geertje Zuiderweg]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-52509545 Levenloos kind.]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on December 11, 1860 in Veendam. 
