1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Died before his father and his wife Anne inherited instead:
2 CONT
2 CONT * MUSE, John Westmoreland County, 5 APR 1723 8 OCT 1723
2 CONT * To son Thomas one shilling;
2 CONT * dau Jane Pritchett one shilling;
2 CONT * dau Anne Willson one shilling;
2 CONT * dau Mary Quisenberry one shilling;
2 CONT * rest of estate to dau in law Anne MUSE
2 CONT
2 CONT ===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=hocott&id=I3938
2 CONT
2 CONT # Abbrev: HOPKINS
2 CONT
2 CONT Title: Walter Lee Hopkins, HOPKINS OF VIRGINIA AND RELATED FAMILIES (Richmond, VA: J. W. Fergusson & Sons, 1931)A: J. W. Fergusson & Sons, 1931.
2 CONT
2 CONT # Abbrev: SOUTHERN LEGACY
2 CONT
2 CONT Title: Compiled by Dr. Roger David Chambers; in collaboration with Lou
2 CONT
2 CONT Andrews Murphy and Robert T. Muse, A SOUTHERN LEGACY: Descendants of John Muse of Virginia (Apparently unpublished; 178 pages)
2 CONT
2 CONT Andrews Murphy and Robert T. Muse, A SOUTHERN LEGACY: Descendants of John Muse of Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT Andrews Murphy and Robert T. Muse. A SOUTHERN LEGACY: Descendants of John Muse of Virginia. Apparently unpublished; 178 pages. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Note from HOPKINS:
2 CONT
2 CONT On Oct. 30, 1707, Thomas Muse, of West'd Co., and John Muse, Jr., of
2 CONT
2 CONT Richmond Co., Va., were granted 265 acres in West'd Co. On Nov. 10,
2 CONT
2 CONT 1711, Nicholas Muse of West'd Co., received a grant of land of 179
2 CONT
2 CONT acres in West'd Co. on Holling Branch on Great Rappahannock Creek,
2 CONT
2 CONT between the counties of Richmond and West'd. (Northern Neck Grant
2 CONT
2 CONT Book No. 4, p. 60).
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes from SOUTHERN LEGACY:
2 CONT
2 CONT John Jr. predeceased his father and was not mentioned in his will.
2 CONT
2 CONT However, John Jr. is proven by the Oct 1699 endorsement in which John
2 CONT
2 CONT Sr. references "his son John Mewes" and 1703 patent assigned "to his
2 CONT
2 CONT son John Mewes, Jr."
2 CONT
2 CONT Also in 1725 John Jr's brother Thomas conveyed to Thomas Muse Jr. a
2 CONT
2 CONT "piece or parcel of land which I purchased of my brother John Muse
2 CONT
2 CONT decd" by deed dated 28 Jul 1718.
2 CONT
2 CONT The children of John and Ann Muse are proven by Ann's will and
2 CONT
2 CONT family records. Ann's will names nine children, and family records
2 CONT
2 CONT name a tenth child named Elizabeth. (Ann's will: Va Will Bk 8, p.
2 CONT
2 CONT 170).
2 CONT
2 CONT Vital statistics on John's children based on "Family Record of John Muse Jr and Descendants," "a small book . . .[ in which] the entries appear to have been made at or close to the dates."
2 CONT -
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Military service''': Colonnel
2 CONT ** Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-40001-981255474/john-l-muse-in-familysearch-family-tree FamilySearch Family Tree] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Feb 4 2021, 21:07:02 UTC''
2 CONT * https://www.colonial-settlers-md-va.us/getperson.php?personID=I24674&tree=Tree1
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT John Muse  was born
2 CONT Abt. 1674, and died Bef. April 06, 1723 in Westmoreland County, Virginia. He
2 CONT married Ann Hopkins. She was born Bef. 1685, and died Bef. June 29, 1726.
2 CONT Children of John Muse and Ann Hopkins are:
2 CONT + 18 i. Edward5 Muse, born February 23, 1705/06 in Virginia; died Abt.
2 CONT 1782 in Westmoreland County, Virginia.
2 CONT + 19 ii. William Muse, born Bef. 1703.
2 CONT + 20 iii. Mary Muse, born December 10, 1699.
2 CONT 21 iv. Hopkins Muse, born Abt. 1710; died 1740 in Caroline County,
2 CONT Virginia.
2 CONT 22 v. John Muse, born Abt. 1710; died Bef. 1779 in Powhattan County,
2 CONT Virginia. He married Frances Chattin November 19, 1754; born in of Lancaster
2 CONT County, Virginia.
2 CONT 23 vi. George Muse, born Abt. 1712 in Westmoreland County, Virginia;
2 CONT died May 1784 in Caroline County, Virginia. He married (1) Elizabeth
2 CONT Landrum. He married (2) Francis Moore; born Abt.1760; died 1846 in Tennessee.
2 CONT 24 vii. Augustine Muse, born Abt. 1710; died 1749 in Caroline County,
2 CONT Virginia.
2 CONT 25 viii. Sarah Muse, born Abt. 1716.
2 CONT 26 ix. Anne Muse, born Abt. 1715.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/152606213/john-muse Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 10 2022, 7:04:40 UTC''
