2 CONT 27-28Nicholas MUSE mar Ann (_____) CULLUM-FINCH.Will of John FINCH, 2 Jan 1765/25 Feb 1775 names “brother Nicholas MUSE” and “sister Anne MUSE.”Nicholas MUSE 2nd mar Elizabeth ASBURY, daughter of Thomas ASBURY and Ann (WALKER) WRI
2 CONC GHT.Will of Ann ASBURY, 10 Nov 1755/25 Nov 1755 names “dau Elizabeth MUSE, Jeremiah, Walker & Penelope MUSE.” Married Well and Often (2003).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 28-29Will of John FINCH now documented, 2 Jan 1765 Westmoreland Co, VA.Names “Brother Nicholas MUSE, sister Mary RANDALL, sister Ann MUSE, brother-in-law Thomas RANDALL."
2 CONT
