2 CONT Meador, Victor P. (Victor Paul), and Bernal M. Meador. Our Meador families in colonial America: as found in the records of Isle of Wight, Lancaster, (old) Rappahannock, Richmond, Essex and Caroline Counties, Virginia. (Independenc
2 CONC e, Missouri: V.P. Meador, 1983)
2 CONT Available on-line at local Family History Centers.
