2 CONT PETER RANSONE & DOROTHY his Wife, Exrx. of THO: GOULDMAN deced, presented ye inventory & appraismt. of ye sd deced Estate upon Oath, except such Estate as was willed by her former Husband, RICHD. AWBREY, in his last Will to be del
2 CONC ivered to his Children in Specialty wch: is ordered to be recorded
