1 NOTE Jeanette W Cuthriell and Laroy A Evans have Richard Herndon and Lucy Poe as George Herndon's parents.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nancy Gobble has Richard Herndon and Sarah Lucy Poe as George Herndon's parents.
2 CONT
2 CONT There was a Sarah Poe that married a William Herndon. William Herndon might have been Richard Herndon's cousin. As I was doing some research I came across common ancestors for George Herndon (b 1731 m Sarah Wingfield b 1732) and J
2 CONC ohn Herndon (b 1742 m Sarah Wingfield b 1746). 
2 CONT
2 CONT At first I thought that the Sarah Wingfield's were the same person but the dates of birth, husbands, and children do not match. 
2 CONT (a.) Sarah Herndon (b About 1762) whose mother Sarah Wingfield married George Herndon married a Henry McCoy (b About 1750).
2 CONT (b.) Sarah Herndon (b 1772) whose mother Sarah Wingfield married John Herndon married George Baber.
2 CONT
2 CONT This started because I had an Elizabeth Beavers (Baeber) who married Abimelec Barbee. I was trying to see if possible Elizabeth Beavers connected to any of my Bevers family that was already in my tree.
2 CONT
2 CONT I found that Elizabeth Beavers parents were George Baber and Sarah Herndon. I knew I had a Sarah Herndon in my tree but the dates of birth did not match up so I listed her as another person. Sarah Herndon’s parents were John Hernd
2 CONC on and Sarah Wingfield. I knew I had a Sarah Wingfield in my tree but I had her married to a George Herndon not a John Herndon so I listed her as a separated person and kept going. I could not find who this Sarah Wingfield’s paren
2 CONC ts were but her husband John Herndon’s parents were William Herndon and Sarah Poe. William Herndon’s parents were James Herndon and Mary Elliott George. James Herndon’s parents were William Herndon and Catherine Digges. William He
2 CONC rndon’s parents were William Herndon and Ann Bishop. William Herndon’s parents were John Herndon and Mary McGregor. John Herndon’s parents were John Herndon and Colita Kinsinton. John Herndon’s parents were Albert John Herndon and
2 CONC  Martha Ann Broderick.
2 CONT
2 CONT I am not sure what made me realize that I had two Colita Kinsintons in my tree but when I started looking at both of them I realized they are the same person. Both married a John Herndon and both Colita’s in laws were Albert John 
2 CONC Herndon and Martha Ann Broderick.
2 CONT
2 CONT The lines are as follows:
2 CONT Albert John Herndon b 1556 m Colita Kinsinton b 1555
2 CONT John Herndon b 1569 m Mary McGregor
2 CONT William Herndon b 1621 m Ann Bishop b 1622
2 CONT William Herndon b 1678 m Catherine Digges b 1645
2 CONT Edward Herndon b m Mary Waller b 1674
2 CONT Richard Herndon b 1708
2 CONT George Herndon b 1731 m Sarah Wingfield b 1732
2 CONT many children
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Albert John Herndon b 1565 m Colita Kinsinton b 1555
2 CONT John Herndon b 1596 m Mary McGregor b 1602
2 CONT William Herndon b 1620 m Ann Bishop b1622
2 CONT William Herndon b 1649 m Catherine Digges b 1654
2 CONT James Herndon b 1683 m Mary Elliott George b 1686
2 CONT William Herndon b 1706 m Sarah Poe b1718
2 CONT John Herndon b 1742 m Sarah Wingfield b 1746
2 CONT Sarah Herndon b 1772 m George Baber b ????
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT I still feel that the Sarah Wingfield who married George Herndon b 1731 and the Sarah Wingfield who married John Herndon b 1742 are the same person but it is not proven.
2 CONT
2 CONT I also wonder if Lucy Poe and Sarah Poe are sisters.
2 CONT
2 CONT I have contacted Jeanette W Cuthriell, Laroy A Evans, Nancy Gobble and asking where they got their information. Jessica Davis Nov 14, 2009
