1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Robert Holloway Bell was a farmer in the Otter District of Bedford County, VA. The family moved from Bedford County, VA to Baltimore, Maryland. He was a fireman in the 1920 Census. After retiring Robert and Mary Be
2 CONC ll lived with their daughter Mary Watts Bell Fales in Leitersburg, Maryland on top of a high hill. Later the family moved from Leitersburg to Winter Street in Hagerstown, Maryland. They both died in Maryland.  He is the son of Fra
2 CONC ncis Henry and Musidora A Turner Bell. Robert married Elizabeth Ann Bower on May 22, 1878 in Bedford County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hagerstown Morning Herald
2 CONT Saturday, June 20, 1925 - Page 7
2 CONT BROUGHT TO HOSPITAL 
2 CONT Robert H. Bell, aged 70 years, Smithsburg, was brought to the Washington County Hospital yesterday where It was found necessary to amputate his left foot which had been injured by being caught in a mowing machine.
2 CONT
