1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Son of Robert Turner Leftwich and Catherine Early.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Robert Turner Leftwich and Catherine Early:
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Adaline Breeding, 1818 to Jul 9, 1853, died in Adair County. Married Robert Montgomery Breeding. He next married her sister Martha and after her death he married Sarah Rowe. He was the son of James Breeding and Margaret Simp
2 CONC son.
2 CONT
2 CONT Silas Early Leftwich 1823 to 1898, buried here.
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha A Breeding 1826 to Jan 28, 1858. Married Robert Montgomery Breeding.
2 CONT
2 CONT Charlotte  Wilson, Jul 1832 to Aug 29, 1858, died at Price's Creek. Married Bryant Yates Wilson in 1855.
2 CONT
2 CONT Catherine Leftwich, Jul 1832 to Aug 29, 1858, died at Price's Creek.
2 CONT
2 CONT Julia A Leftwich, 1835 to Oct 12, 1890. Married Zachariah Walkup in 1854. She died in Adair County.
2 CONT
2 CONT John Wesley Leftwich, 1837 to Apr 14, 1881, died in Pettis, Missouri. Married Mary F Sexton in 1858 and Hannah Chandler in 1861 and Sarah Ellen Beeman in 1868.
2 CONT
2 CONT George W Leftwich born 1837
2 CONT
2 CONT James Ellis Leftwich, Jun 29, 1838 to Apr 16, 1916, buried in Pierce City Cemetery Lawrence County, Missouri. Married Martha Hughes who is probably buried here, Susan Patterson who is probably buried here,  Jemima Catherine Nelson
2 CONC   who is buried there , Katherine Lester and Sarah Agnes Pile.
2 CONT
2 CONT J A Leftwich born 1839.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jesse T Leftwich 1841 to 1861, buried here.
2 CONT
2 CONT William Blair Leftwich , May 12, 1844 to Aug 1, 1912, buried in Elkhart Cemetery in Logan County, IL.. Married Volumnia Dohoney and Margaret Grady.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/96431139/silas-early-leftwich Fin
2 CONC d A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 6 2023, 16:11:48 UTC''
