1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/195461077/william-brown
2 CONT William was the son of Michael Brown and Elizabeth Shelton.  
2 CONT He appears on the 1850 census record for Clinton County, Kentucky and again on the 1860 census record for Fentress County, Tennessee.   
2 CONT William married Aria Ann "Ary" Young in about 1850.  
2 CONT His date of death and burial location are unknown.  
2 CONT William is presumed to have died between 1865, when his last child was born and 1870, when his wife is listed as widowed on the 1870 census record for Fentress, Tennessee. 
2 CONT
2 CONT William Brown and Aria Ann "Ary" Young had the following children: 
2 CONT # Mary Elizabeth "Betty" Brown 1851–
2 CONT # James Robert Brown 1853–1929
2 CONT # David Travis Brown  1855–1910.  David Travis Brown married Sarah Melissa "Minnie" Perryman on 19 May 1880 in Scott County, Tennessee. 
2 CONT # Sarilda Jane Brown Keeth  1856–1938 (her birth year is given as 1846 on her death cert, but she first appears at age 2 in the 1860 census).  Sarilda Jane Brown married William Harrison Keith 25 Nov 1877 in Adair County, Kentucky
2 CONC . 
2 CONT # William Brown 1864– 
2 CONT # Sarah Ann Brown Conatser 1865–1928.  Sarah Ann Brown married George W. Conatser
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/195461077/william-brown Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 12 2026, 21:11:04 UTC''
