1 NAME Enoch C /Brown/
2 GIVN Enoch C
2 SURN Brown
2 _MARNM Brown
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Shelton Cemetery, Fairplay,															Adair County,															Kentucky,																USA
