1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thomas Jefferson Brown was born to Elizabeth Shelton and Michael Brown on January 15, 1852 and his birth was recorded at the courthouse as Jefferson Brown. This actual birth date differs considerably from that whic
2 CONC h is on his tombstone, which appears to be fairly new. He was enumerated in  Clinton County, Kentucky for the Federal Census in 1860, 1870 and 1880 as follows:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1860 -- He was listed as Thomas J. Brown, age 8 (born about 1852), in his mother's household on the 1860 Clinton Co., KY Census. His father, Michael Brown, had already died. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1870 Clinton Co., Kentucky Census; District 5; Written Page 16; Post Office Albany; August 15th; Line 9; Household and Visit #108-108: BROWN, Elizabeth, age 67, female, white, occupation - keeping house, [spaces for value of real 
2 CONC estate and personal property are blank, but next door her brother, Elijah SHELTON, owns real estate worth $300], born in South Carolina; Eli H., 18 m, w, KY; Thomas J., 16 (born about 1854), KY <----
2 CONT
2 CONT 1880 Wayne Co., Kentucky Census; Slickford; Magisterial District 3; SD 3; ED 104; Written Page 17; Stamped Page 53-A; June 9th; Household and Visit # 151-153 BROWN, Thomas J., 24 (born about 1856), husband,Tennessee KY __ ; Ila, 2
2 CONC 2, wife, KY __ __; Rosa E., 4, dau., KY Tennessee __; Mary J., 2, dau., KY Tennessee __ (NOTE:  Thomas J. BROWN  was living two doors down from his brother, Elijah, and Jane (BERTRAM) BROWN on this census.)  
2 CONT
2 CONT He next was listed on census in 1910 in Oklahoma with his wife, Ila, called "Iley".  The census shows this was his first and only marriage. She was his first cousin, the daughter of Rosannah (Burk) and Elijah Shelton. His wife, Il
2 CONC a Shelton was born about 1859 in Adair County, Kentucky according to the 1910 census and family knowledge. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1910 Washita Co., Oklahoma Census; Cordell Township; SD 5; ED 260; Sheet 2-A; Page 61-A; Line 35; April 18th; Household and Visit #25-25: BROWN, Thomas J., head, male, white, age 56 (born about 1854), married 1 time - married 36 y
2 CONC ears, born in Kentucky, father born in the US, mother born in Tennessee, farmer; Iley, wife, female, white, age 53, married 1 time - married 36 years, mother of 4 children - 4 children still living, born in Kentucky, both parents 
2 CONC born in Tennessee; Lucinda, daughter, female, white, age 16, single, born in Oklahoma, both parents born in Kentucky; BARKER, David, boarder, male, white, age 22, single, born in Arkansas, father born in Missouri, mother born in A
2 CONC rkansas* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/17949769/thomas_jefferson-brown Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 12 2026, 21:11:04 UTC''
