2 CONT
2 CONT * Birth: 	Aug. 13, 1846 Dallas County Texas, USA
2 CONT * Death: 	Apr. 29, 1918 Grayson County Texas, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Susan Callahan Cole was the daughter of John Pope "Jack" Cole and Susannah Hulda Leonard. She married Richard "Rick" Haines Durrett. After Richard death Susan married a Mr. Johnson. His name is unknown at this time.
2 CONT
2 CONT Susan Callahan Cole and Richard Haines Durrett had the following children: 
2 CONT # Richard Cleveland Durrett born 17 Sep 1865 died 17 Feb 1952 buried at Cederlawn Memorial Park, Sherman, Grayson County, Texas married Ollie Safronia Fielder
2 CONT # Mary Etta Hestine Durrett born 1 August died 21 Aug 1937 burial at Lyons Cemetery, Rose Hill, Dallas County, Texas married George McFarland Sanders (His sister Cora Missouri Ellen Sanders married Mary Etta's brother Charles Albe
2 CONC rt Durrett)
2 CONT # Francis Lee Durrett b. 16 Nov 1869 d. 7 Nov 1913 burial Pleasant Mound Cemetery, Dallas, Dallas County, Texas married William Ennis Chap Beech
2 CONT # Charles Albert Durrett v. 21 Nov 1971 d. 6 Sep 1945 burial Portales Cemetery, Portales, Roosevelt County, New Mexico married Cora Missouri Ellen Sanders (brother is George McFarland Sanders m. Mary Etta Hestine Durrett)
2 CONT # Conner Durrett b. 25 Dec 1873 d. 20 Sep 1940 burial Ethel Cemetery, Ethel, Grayson County, Texas m. John M. Sanders (unknown if he is related to George and Cora) 2nd B Bryant 3 Dave Dodson
2 CONT # Dorris Milton b. Sep 1877 
2 CONT # Milton Haynes Durrett b. 19 Oct 1880 d. 7 Oct 1928 burial Long Creek Cemetery, Sunnyvale, Dallas County, Texas m. Nora Virginia Casteel
2 CONT
