1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Funeral services for Otia R. Drake, 83, 1407 Brandon Street, who died yesterday at 3 p. m. will be held today at 3 p. m. from the Holmes St. Methodist Church. The Rev. M. E. Coleman will officiate. Burial will foll
2 CONC ow in Maple Hill Cemetery. Mr. Drake, a member of the Holmes Street Methodist Church, resided in Huntsville for the past 18 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is survived by his wife, Mrs. Minnie Ikard Drake, and two daughters, Miss Grace Drake and Miss Ira Mae Drake, both of Brandon Street.
2 CONT
2 CONT Active pallbearers will be Marvin Drake, Shelby Drake, Jimmy Ray Gattis, Elton Whitaker, Clarence Allen, Paul Thomas, J. H. Draughon, R. C. Buckhardt and Howard Moore. Honorary pallbearers will be members of Mr. Drake's Sunday Sch
2 CONC ool class.
2 CONT
2 CONT Originally published in The Huntsville Times on Sunday, September 4, 1955 
