1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mosby Drake was killed in 2003.  His brother gave the following account of this death, "My brother was killed near the double oak tree where New Hope High School stands.  Clifton was in a fight with a unknown perso
2 CONC n there, and this person took Clifton's head & beat it against the tree until he was dead.  We never did know the reason for the fight."  Bobby Drake.
