1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=82966401&ref=wvr
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 1st Jabez Monroe Drake 3/20/1855 in Franklin Co., AL and 2nd William Anderson Stockton 6/8/1875.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Jane and Jabez Monroe Drake children are Addison Bunton, William Whitfield, Mary Agnes, Emma Lee, and Effie Jabez Drake.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Jane and William Anderson Stockton children are Charlie Gilbert, Lennie Mae, and Edna Eulalia Stockton.
2 CONT
2 CONT THE MOULTON ADVERTISER Thursday August 18, 1881
2 CONT
2 CONT Died, of Meningetis, Typhoid Fever and Tonsillitis, while on a visit to her mother, in Franklin county, Alabama, on August 7th, 1881, Mrs. J. STOCKTON, consort of Elder William A. STOCKTON, of this county.
