2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT From Savage 
2 CONT
2 CONT >... GEORGE, Windsor, br. of Christopher, acc. to Stiles, 770, rem. to Simsbury, m. 17 Dec. 1691, Abigail, perhaps d. of Nathaniel Bissell, wh. Stiles prints Russell, had, he says, Hannah, b. 23 May previous, and he d. 5 Dec. 1697
2 CONC . Very much confusion to this name exists, and it may not be wholly dissipat. by reducing two Georges to one.
