2 CONT
2 CONT -----
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://mhollick.typepad.com/slovakyankee/2014/12/john-drake-ca-1590-1659-of-windsor-connecticut.html
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. John Drake was born about 1590 and died 17 August 1659 at Windsor, Connecticut.  He married first at Hampton in Arden, England on 25 June 1616, Lettice Shakespeare who died there 10 November 1623. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John married secondly about 1624 Elizabeth Rogers born say 1600 and died 7 October 1681 at Windsor, Connecticut.  
2 CONT
2 CONT By his first wife, John was the father of: 
2 CONT * John, married Hannah Moore
2 CONT * Esther, d.y.
2 CONT * Job, married  Mary Wollcott
2 CONT * Jacob, married Mary Bissell
2 CONT
2 CONT By his second wife he was the father of: 
2 CONT * Elizabeth married 1) William Gaylord 2) John Elderkin
2 CONT * Mary married John Gaylord 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT # Unpublished resesearch by Douglas Richardson.
2 CONT # Descendants of John Drake of Windsor, Connecticut by Frank B. Gay (Rutland, VT, 1933), p.1-13.
2 CONT # The American Genealogist 65 (1990):87-8.
2 CONT # The American Genealogist 63 (1988):193-206.
2 CONT # New York Genealogical & Biographical Record 2 (1871):99-101.
2 CONT # Genealogy of the Elderkin Family by D.W. Elderkin (1888).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Discussion of  possible relationship scenarios to William Shakespeare:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Shakespeare-25
2 CONT
2 CONT Lettice married John Drake on June 25th, 1615 in Hampton in Arden, Warwickshire.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Potential Parents:
2 CONT Anthony Shakespeare     15411616     GZCY-823
2 CONT Unknown wife/mistress</line><line /><line>Genealogist Douglas Richardson, the genealogist who discovered the origins of John Drake of Windsor in 1991, identified Lettice's father as Anthony. 
2 CONT Source: Narkive discussion post attributed to Douglas Richardson, Salt Lake City, Utah, abt. 2009, Subject: Ancestry of Warren Buffet from John Drake</line><line /><line>10/30/21</line><line /><line>https://soc.genealogy.medieval.
2 CONC narkive.com/1DuwFZ45/ancestry-of-warren-buffet</line><line /><line>***Update***
2 CONT OR</line><line /><line>Marriage: 14 November 1573 Budbrooke, Warwickshire, England
2 CONT Joan Whitrefe     KHXB-QHZ</line><line /><line>3/1/22
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
