2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Job & Elizabeth (Alvord) Drake
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Hannah Burnham 9 Oct 1717 in South Windsor, Hartford, CT - parents of Hannah, Jonathan, Elizabeth, Ann, Nancy, Job, Marcus & Gideon Drake
2 CONT
2 CONT Jeremiah is buried at Edwards Cem, South Windsor, Hartford, CT
2 CONT
2 CONT Jeremiah Drake.
