2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Jeremiah Drake===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 11 Sep 1684 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Job Drake and Elizabeth (Alvord) Drake
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Jonathan Drake, Elizabeth (Drake) Rockwell and Rebecca Drake
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Hannah (Burnham) Drake — married 17 Oct 1717 in South Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Hannah (Drake) Bissell, Jonathan Drake, Elizabeth Drake, Ann (Drake) Prior, Nancy Drake, Job Drake, Marcus Drake and Gideon Drake
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 25 Nov 1746 at age 62 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 11 May 2019 | Created 25 Sep 2016
