1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Mindwell was born to Captain John Higley and Hannah Drake about 1689, in Simsbury, Connecticut.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT *Married 1st 1714 Jonathan Hutchinson
2 CONT *Married 2nd 1727 James Tisdale
2 CONT *Married 3rd 1729 Nathaniel Fitch 
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: "Descendants of the Reverend James Fitch 1622-1702" Second Edition
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Mindwell married first Jonathan Hutchinson on 2 Sep 1714. He died on 10 Sep 1717. Mindwell and Jonathan had the following known children:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Hannah, b 23 May 1715; d 26 May 1725
2 CONT # Mindwell, b 13 Sep 1717; d within a month in Oct 1717
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Mindwell married second 2 Feb 1727, James Tisdale of Lebanon, Connecticut (supposedly a widower). There were no children from this marriage. James died a short three months later on 2 May 1727
2 CONT
2 CONT On 17 Sep 1729, Mindwell married Capt. Nathaniel Fitch, a gentleman of "prominent position". He was a widower with several children. Mindwell and Nathaniel lived on a farm near Lebanon, Connecticut and had the following known chil
2 CONC dren:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Jabez, b 4 Oct 1730; d 14 Nov 1736
2 CONT # Ezekiel, b 11 Mar 1732
2 CONT # Isaac, b 20 May 1734
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Mindwell is buried at Old Cemetery, Lebanon, New London, CT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Jonathan HUTCHENSON Birth: Abt 1685 Lebanon, New London, Connecticut Death: 10 Sep 1717 Marriage: 4 Sep 1714 Simsbury, Hartford, Connecticut Father: John HUTCHINSON Mother: Hannah ROOT User Submitted Individual Information Mindwel
