2 CONT Sarah (Porter) Drake (1655 - 1730)
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Sarah Drake formerly Porter===
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 5 Sep 1655 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of John Porter Jr and Mary (Stanley) Porter
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of John Porter, Mary (Porter) Phelps, James Porter, Nathaniel Porter, Hannah (Porter) Loomis, Samuel Porter, Rebecca (Porter) Loomis, Hester Porter, Ruth (Porter) Loomis, Hezekiah Porter and Joseph Porter
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Enoch Drake Sr. — married 11 Nov 1680 (to 1698) in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Josiah Barber — married 5 Nov 1701 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Sarah Porter (Drake) Trumbull, Enoch Drake Jr, Nathaniel Drake Sr., Samuel Drake and Hannah (Drake) Sheldon
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 13 Dec 1730 at age 75 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 24 Dec 2021 | Created 28 Nov 2010
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah was born in c. 1654. [1] She married Enoch Drake on 11 Nov 1680 in Windsor, CT. [2] Sarah's parents were John Porter and Mary Stanley. [3]She died 13 Dec 1730 [4]
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage(2)
2 CONT
2 CONT Josiah Barber married (2) Sarah Drake in Windsor, Connecticut on 05 November 1701. Both were residents of Windsor. [5]
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Josiah Barber by March 12, 1701/2. [6]
2 CONT
