1 NOTE {geni:about_me} >====Wikitree: https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Loomis-237 Joseph Loomis III (1649-1715)
2 CONT >'''Born''' 15 Jul 1649 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut Colony
2 CONT >'''Son of''' Joseph Loomis Jr and Sarah (Hill) Loomis
2 CONT >'''Husband of''' Lydia (Drake) Loomis — married 10 Apr 1681 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT >'''Husband of''' Abigail (Gillette) Loomis — married 11 Feb 1702 [location unknown]
2 CONT >''Died''' before 1739 before age 89 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut Colony
2 CONT >'''''Please''''' be content with clicking the Wikitree link above to read other information and scrutinized the source there instead of doing a wholesale copy-and-paste job into any Overviews.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT JOSEPH LOOMIS who was born July 15 1649 and died Feb 26 1715 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married April 10 1681 Lydia Drake who was born January 26 1662 and died May 7 1702 daughter of John Drake of Windsor He removed to East Windsor Conn in 1700 where he died T
2 CONT
2 CONT Their fourth child was LYDIA LOOMIS 4 who married Isaac Hinsdale 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source:''' [http://books.google.com/books?id=rPdUAAAAMAAJ&pg=PA119&lpg=PA119&dq=%22Ezra+Hinsdale%22+1766&source=bl&ots=rQgUQogo_d&sig=tPF6HQXsBxAB0TIHekC2CRBxNqc&hl=en&ei=ecnKTraMA4ugtwfv5M22DA&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&res
2 CONC num=4&sqi=2&ved=0CC4Q6AEwAw#v=onepage&q=%22Ezra%20Hinsdale%22%201766&f=false ''Hinsdale Genealogy'']: ''Descendants of Robert Hinsdale of Dedham, Medfield'' ... By Herbert Cornelius Andrews, Sanford Charles Hinsdale
2 CONT
