1 NOTE He was ensign, 1752; 1st Lieut, in invasion of Canada, 1758; Capt. 1761. One of his great-great-grandsons is Oliver Patridge Dickinson, of Chicago. IL He owned at least one slave, a negro man. See N. E . H. & Gen. Reg., Vol. LII.
2 CONT
