2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Robe formerly Barber
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 12 Jul 1669 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Thomas Barber II and Mary (Phelps) Barber
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of John Barber, Mary Barber, Joanna (Barber) Colt, Anna Barber, Thomas Barber III, Samuel Barber, Ann (Barber) Higley and Unnamed Barber
2 CONT
