2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 9 Oct 2019 | Created 17 May 2012
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Barber was born in 1669 in Windsor, to Thomas Barber and Mary (Phelps) Barber.[1] Sarah was admitted to full communion in the Simsbury church in 1697 or 1698.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah and Andrew Robe, Sr., married and had at least one son, Andrew Robe, Jr.[2],[3] Sarah also helped raise Andrew's daughters Mary, Elizabeth, and Amy.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah passed away in 1748, at the age of 78.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
