1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John2 RISING (James1) was born 4 April 1660 at Salem, Essex, Massachusetts, and was christened at Salem, Essex, Massachusetts. He was the son of James RISING and Elizabeth HINSDALE. John died 11 December 1719 at Su
2 CONC ffield, Hartford, Connecticut. He married (1) Sarah HALE 27 November 1684 at Suffield, Hartford, Connecticut. She was born 23 April 1665 at Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut, the daughter of Timothy HEALD and Sarah BARBER. Sarah died
2 CONC  11 October 1698. 
