2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail was the daughter of Josiah & Abigail (Loomis) Barber
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Cornelius Brown, son of Peter & Mary (Gillett) Brown, on 4 Dec 1701 at Windsor, Hartford, CT - parents of Abigail, Mabel, Rachel, Cornelius, Huldah, Hepzibah, Titus, Elizabeth & Aaron Brown
2 CONT
2 CONT She is buried at Palisado Cemetery, Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT From Genealogical and Personal History of Western Pennsylvania:
2 CONT
2 CONT  (David Griswold) He married, December 23, 1731, Huldah, daughter of Deacon Cornelius and Abigail (Loomis) Brown.
