2 CONT Sarah (Porter) Drake (1655 - 1730)
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Sarah Drake formerly Porter===
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 5 Sep 1655 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of John Porter Jr and Mary (Stanley) Porter
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of John Porter, Mary (Porter) Phelps, James Porter, Nathaniel Porter, Hannah (Porter) Loomis, Samuel Porter, Rebecca (Porter) Loomis, Hester Porter, Ruth (Porter) Loomis, Hezekiah Porter and Joseph Porter
