1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Patience Barber was the daughter of James & Unknown Barber - she married John Cole II in Plympton, MA 1709 - parents of John II & Joseph
2 CONT
2 CONT "James Barber had Mary 1692, Hezekiah 1696, b. here, and there is no farther account of this family. Patience Barber married John Cole of Plympton 1709"
2 CONT
2 CONT When Patience Barber was born on September 17, 1689, in Dorchester, Massachusetts, her father, James, was 37, and her mother, Elizabeth, was 30. She married John Cole on January 27, 1710, in Bridgewater, Massachusetts. They had ni
2 CONC ne children in 25 years. She died in 1735 in Swansea, Massachusetts, at the age of 46.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Barber-3013
2 CONT
