2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT From Barber Genealogy, Descendants of Thomas Barber of Windsor, Conn. 1614-1909. Descendants of John Barber of Worcester, 1714-1909
2 CONT
2 CONT 293. ANN BARBER,^ (Samuel,* Joseph, Samuel, Thomas,*) b. Mch. 2, 1736; m. Oct. 17. 1754, Samuel Phelps, who was b. in Harwinton, Conn., Feb. 15, 1736.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children : Bom in Harwinton.
2 CONT
2 CONT * +825. I. Samuel Phelps, b. July 20, 1755 or 56.
2 CONT * -[-826. II. Hezekiah Phelps, b. Jan. 6, 1758.
2 CONT * -1-827. III. Silas (or Giles) Phelps, b. Dec. 13, 1759.
2 CONT * H-828. IV. Ira Phelps, b. May 30, 1763.
2 CONT * +829. V. Uri Phelps, b. July IS, 1755.
2 CONT * 830. VI. Anna Phelps, b. Nov. 8, 1767.
2 CONT * 4-831. VII. Evan Phelps, b. Apr. 6, 1777.
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Phelps was a lineal descendant of William Phelps, known in early records as Ould Mr. Phelps, the line of descent being, Samuel, Lieut. Samuel,* Lieut. Samuel, Joseph,^ William.* Samuel Phelps resided in Harwinton and ser\-e
2 CONC d in the Revolutionary War, in Col. Humphreys regiment. He d. in Haruinton, July 28, 1805.
2 CONT
