2 CONT Brief Life History of Sarah
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT When Sarah Thrall was born on 3 February 1742, in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America, her father, David Thrall Sr, was 32 and her mother, Jane Barber, was 21. She married Edward Thompson about 1771, in
2 CONC  Hartford, Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 4 daughters. She died in 1833, in East Granby, Hartford, Connecticut, United States, at the age of 91, and was buried in East Gr
2 CONC anby, Hartford, Connecticut, United States.
