1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Catherine Barber Adams=
2 CONT * BIRTH 1755 Harwinton, Litchfield County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * DEATH Jul 1807 (aged 51–52) Wellsburg, Brooke County, West Virginia, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Burial Details Unknown
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 192289782
2 CONT
2 CONT Catherine (Barber) Adams was born in 1755 in Harwinton, Connecticut, her father, Rev. Reuben Barber, who served as a Private during the Revolutionary War, was 27 when he married her mother, Sarah Merriman, who was 26. Catherine ma
2 CONC rried Samuel Adams 3rd (aka Jr.) on February 8, 1770, in Canterbury, Connecticut. They had seven children during their marriage. She died in July 1807 in Wellsburg, West Virginia, at the age of 52.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Gravesite Details'''
2 CONT Unmarked grave in section of interments moved from old Brooke cemetery near the Ohio River.
