2 CONT Daniel Phelps BIRTH	24 Jan 1759 Hebron, Tolland County, Connecticut, USA DEATH	1 Nov 1852 (aged 93) BURIAL	 Andover Road Cemetery Hebron, Tolland County, Connecticut, USA MEMORIAL ID	45183604 · View Source MEMORIAL PHOTOS 1 FLOWER
2 CONC S 4 PLANT TREES Capt. Daniel Phelps was the son of Amos Phelps and Anna Filler. He was born in Hebron, Ct., 24 Jan 1759, and married Sally Bliss, 16 Jan 1793. She was born 18 Mar 1771, died Jan 1846, the daughter of Hezekiah Bliss
2 CONC . Mr. Phelps, soon after marrying, settled in Dexter, Michigan, where he died in 1853 in his 94th year.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children, born in Dexter, Mich.: Augustus, born 1794. William Ralph Martin Sarah, married Benjamin Bliss. Fanny, born 1812. Settled in Buffalo, N.Y. John. Note.-- First two children born probably in Hebron, Ct. ("The Phelps family
2 CONC  of America", p 229, 397)
2 CONT
