2 CONT
2 CONT '''Mary Groombridge/Grombridge''' was 
2 CONT * born on 7 Jan 1605/6 in Horsham, co. Sussex, England.[101,102]	
2 CONT * She immigrated in Apr 1635 to MA in the ship the "Planter" with her husband and daughter Elizabeth.[103,104,105]
2 CONT * She died after 1648/49.[106]  '''Sources:'''
2 CONT * 101 Bushnell, Bushnell Family Genealogy, p. 31.
2 CONT * 102 GM 1634-1635, I:511 [Source: Hotten 49].
2 CONT * 103 Bushnell, Bushnell Family Genealogy, p. 31 [Source: Hottons Lists of Emigrants].
2 CONT * 104 Savage, Vol. I, p. 317.
2 CONT * 105 GM 1634-1635, I:512 [Source: Hotten 49].
2 CONT * 106 Bushnell, Bushnell Family Genealogy, p. 31.
2 CONT
2 CONT  ***********************
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Francis Bushnell married in Horsham, 27 Jun 1631, Mary Grombridge, baptized at Horsham, Sussex, England, 7 Jan 1605/6, daughter of Thomas &amp; Agnes (Ive) Grombridge (aged 26 in 1635). They had 8 children: Mary, Elizabeth Johnson
2 CONC , Sarah Ingham, John, Martha Smith, Mary Jones, Hannah Hosmer, &amp; Samuel.
