1 NAME Francis /Bushnell/
2 GIVN Francis
2 _MARNM Bushnell
1 SEX M
1 BAPM
2 DATE 8 JAN 1609
2 ADDR
3 CITY Horsham
3 STAE England
1 BIRT
2 DATE BEF 8 JAN 1609
