1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [http://person.ancestry.com/tree/42722996/person/19897243113 Ancestry Genealogy] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 21 2016, 21:06:10 UTC' 
2 CONT
2 CONT  ********************** http://www.wellswooster.com/tree/getperson.php?personID=I23098&tree=bryant
2 CONT
2 CONT Name  Martha Bushnell  [1] 
2 CONT * Born  Abt 1640  probably, Guilford, New Haven Co, Connecticut   [2]  
2 CONT * Gender  Female 
2 CONT * Father  Francis Bushnell, Deacon,   d. 04 Dec 1681, Saybrook, Middlesex Co, Connecticut  
2 CONT *  Mother  Marie Grombridge,   d. Aft 1649  
2 CONT * Married  27 Jun 1631  Horsham, Sussex, England   [3, 4]  
2 CONT * Family  Jonathan Smith,   b. probably, Glastonbury, Hartford Co, Connecticut  
2 CONT ** Married  01 Jan 1663/64  Saybrook, Middlesex Co, Connecticut   [5, 6] 
2 CONT ** Jonathan Smith was married to Martha Bushnell this first of January in the year of our lord 1663
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Sources:===
2 CONT
2 CONT *  '''See more at:''' http://www.wellswooster.com/tree/getperson.php?personID=I23098&tree=bryant#sthash.nXOfEf3M.dpuf
2 CONT * 1) [S177] Saunders, Chapman-Thomson, Dorothy Chapman Saunders, Ph.D., (Author, Stuart, FL, 1983), p.59.
2 CONT * 2) [S312] The Great Migration, Anderson, Robert Charles & George F. Sanborn, Melinde Lutz Sanborn, (New England Historic Genealogical Society, Boston, Massachusetts, 1999), p. 511.
2 CONT * 3) [S177] Saunders, Chapman-Thomson, Dorothy Chapman Saunders, Ph.D., (Author, Stuart, FL, 1983), p.57.
2 CONT * 4) [S312] The Great Migration, Anderson, Robert Charles & George F. Sanborn, Melinde Lutz Sanborn, (New England Historic Genealogical Society, Boston, Massachusetts, 1999), p. 510.
2 CONT * 5) [S233] Saybrook Founders, Descendants, Staplins, Elaine F., Chairman, (The Founders Committee, Saybrook, CT, 1985), Francis Bushnell.
2 CONT * 6) [S357] Saybrook Vital Records, (CONNECTICUT HISTORICAL SOCIETY, Hartford, CT).
2 CONT
