1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/16163400/joseph-skinner#view-photo=4742854
2 CONT
2 CONT The son of John & Mary (Easton) Skinner, he married (1) Dorothy Hosmer, daughter of Deacon Stephen Hosmer & Hannah Bushnell and (2) Elizabeth Olmsted, daughter of Deacon Joseph & Elizabeth (Butler) Olmsted. Joseph full communion a
2 CONC t First Church of Hartford on May 1, 1709.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children by first marriage:
2 CONT #Joseph b. Oct. 27, 1679, m. Mary Hinsdale
2 CONT #Stephen b. Aug. 7, 1699, died young
2 CONT #Jonathan b. April, 1701, died young
2 CONT #John died June, 1704
2 CONT
2 CONT (Families of Early Hartford, Connecticut, p. 534)]
2 CONT
2 CONT [Joseph and Dorothy Hosmer were married at Hartford, Hartford County, Connecticut on 01 January 1695/1696. Dorothy was born 1674 in Hartford and died at Hartford in March 1701/1702.]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/16163400/joseph-skinner
