1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Katherine Post Hill=
2 CONT * BIRTH 15 Sep 1627 Hollingbourne, Maidstone Borough, Kent, England
2 CONT * DEATH 9 Jan 1693 (aged 65) Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Burial Details Unknown 
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID  197262220  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT Stephen Post 1604–1659
2 CONT Elinor Panton Post 1605–1670
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouses'''
2 CONT Alexander Chalker 1625 – unknown (m. 1649)
2 CONT John "Goodman" Hill I 1615–1689 (m. 1673)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT John Post 1626–1710
2 CONT Thomas Post 1628–1701
2 CONT Abraham Post Sr 1640–1694
2 CONT
