1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===John Post
2 CONT *Born 16 Sep 1629 in Otham, Kent, England
2 CONT * Died 27 Nov 1710 in Norwich, New London, Connecticut
2 CONT *Son of Stephen Post and Elinor (Panton) Post
2 CONT *Brother of Kateren (Post) Hill, Thomas Post, Joseph Post and	Abraham Post
2 CONT *Husband of Hester (Hyde) Post — married Mar 1652 in Saybrook, Middlesex, Connecticut
2 CONT *Father of Margaret (Post) Abell, Elizabeth (Post) Dorman, John Post, Sarah (Post) Hough, Mary (Post) Rudd, Abigail Post, Samuel Post, Hannah Post and Lydia (Post) Harris
2 CONT
2 CONT Aged 84 years (born c1626).
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Hester Hyde March, 1652 at Saybrook, Connecticut and is one of the original proprietors of Norwich, Connecticut.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was baptized on September 13, 1629 in Otham, Kent, England.
2 CONT
