1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 15205. Joseph Post. Born ca 1681 in Norwich, CT. Joseph died in Norwich, CT on 23 Apr 1749.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT On 20 Nov 1733 Joseph married '''Mary Post,''' daughter of Dea. Abraham Post (7 Jun 1669-31 Jan 1747/8) & Elizabeth Stevens (14 Jul 1668-15 Nov 1755), in Westbrook, CT. Born on 3 Jun 1711 in Saybrook, CT. Mary died in Simsbury, CT
2 CONC , on 27 Mar 1760; she was 48.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary first married Joseph Post, second William Hayes as his second wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary and Joseph were first cousins once removed; his father and her paternal grandfather were brothers.
