2 CONT
2 CONT Silas Holcomb Birth 27 Nov 1734 Granby, Hartford, CT Death 6 Oct 1806 North Granby, Hartford, CT Age: 71
2 CONT
2 CONT Father Judah Holcomb
2 CONT        1706 – 1802 Mother Hannah Buttolph
2 CONT        1711 – 1765
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse Mary Post
2 CONT        1743 – 1781
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Mary Holcomb
2 CONT    Born 1763
