2 CONT * BIRTH 23 Jun 1766
2 CONT * DEATH 2 Jun 1829 (aged 62)
2 CONT * BURIAL Scott Cemetery, Huntington Mills, Luzerne County, Pennsylvania, USA
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 28390187 Photos by Sherry Keefer Bonham
2 CONT
2 CONT Gideon Post, a native of Connecticut and a soldier of the Revolution, was a pioneer of Huntington township, this county, where he resided until his death. His children were Gideon, James P., Josiah, Lewis, Betsey (Mrs. Charles Bar
2 CONC rett) and Sabry (Mrs. Merritt Harrison).
2 CONT
