1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/45178568/joseph-phelps
2 CONT
2 CONT Lieut Joseph Phelps IV BIRTH	27 Mar 1742 Hebron, Tolland County, Connecticut, USA DEATH	7 Jan 1795 (aged 52) Hebron, Tolland County, Connecticut, USA BURIAL	 Andover Road Cemetery Hebron, Tolland County, Connecticut, USA MEMORIAL 
2 CONC ID	45178568 · View Source
2 CONT
2 CONT MEMORIAL PHOTOS 0 FLOWERS 11 Joseph PHELPS IV was the son of Lt Joseph PHELPS III and Lydia ROWLEY, born on 27 Mar 1742 in Hebron, Tolland Co., CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT His lineage going back is: Joseph PHELPS III, Joseph PHELPS II, Joseph PHELPS I, Lt. Timothy PHELPS, Mr. William PHELPS the immigrant from Crewkerne, Somersetshire, England and settled in both Dorchester, MA and Windsor, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Jemima POST, daughter of Dr. Israel POST and Phoebe "Phebe" "Pheby" BALDWIN (not Griswold, already disproven), on 6 Dec 1764 in Hebron, Tolland Co., CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following 11 children: 1. Lydia PHELPS 1765-1767
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Sybil PHELPS Kilborn 1767-1849, m. Amasa KILBORN (b. 1781, Connecticut;, d. 1844, Ohio).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Joseph PHELPS V 1769-1851, m.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Jemima PHELPS 1771-1775, died young
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Jabez Baldwin PHELPS 1777-1851, m. Lydia JOHNSON, dau. of Abner JOHNSON and Lydia AVERY.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gen Martin PHELPS 1786-1848, m. Laura JOHNSON, dau. of Abner JOHNSON & Lydia AVERY.
2 CONT
2 CONT Still working on this first.
