1 CONC ho lived dear Bayard, IA.  When his brother Seth turned 16 in 1900, Seth joined Fred at the Pangburn Farm.  In 1915, Fred and Seth bought a farm near Montevideo, MN.  In later years, Fred was employed by the Federal Land Bank and 
1 CONC Seth sold his share of the farm to Fred's sons, Emery and Leslie.  Fred died of a heart attack in 1954.[CRONE Family-1.FTW]
