0 @N6000000000337410280@ NOTE Source #1:  Henry R. Stiles, "The History and Genealogies of Ancient Windsor, Connecticut 1635-1891" (Rockport, ME:  Picton Press, Feb 2000 reprint of 1893 original) Vol II, pp. 76-77
